<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHISOWERU SHIWAGIRA SHAKALEMBITI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka ndo shintola shimu wamu pa vintora vyamsheshi vya Lipatanu lya Syayi vyaviyowelera makaliru ga Yesu Kristu. Kila shimu shishemwa “Injili, mana yakuwi Shisoweru Shiwagira.” Avi ndo vintora vyavilembitwi Pakuhowa kwa Yesu, vintora vyeni ndo Matayu na Mariku na Luka na Yohani. Luka kalembiti ndiri matakuliru kuusu makaliru ga Yesu hera, kumbiti viraa kalembiti kuusu vitwatira vyeni wantumintumi wa Yesu wavitenditi pakuhowa na kuzyuka kwa Yesu. Vitwatira avi vyavitenditwi viwera mushintola sha Matendu ga wantumintumi. Kwahera yakayimana tarehi teratera ya Shisoweru Shiwagira ntambu yakashilembiti Luka, ama pahala pashilembitwi. Wabetula wamonga wajimilirana kuwera Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi shilembitwi mushinja sha malongu saba Pakwiyuka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlemba gwa Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi ndo Luka, mweni kaweriti bwana mganga. Umana wa ulemba wakuwi na ntambu ya matakuliru gakuwi galanguziya kuwera kaweriti muntu mbetula. Luka kafiriti kulemba matakuliru ganakaka kuusu makaliru ga Yesu kwa kutakulira vitwatira ntambu yavilawiriti su wamonga wapati utanga pawagabetula (Luka 1:1-3). Luka kaweriti ndiri Muyawudi (Wakolosayi 4:10-14), na kalembiti kwantambu walii yawawera Wayawudi ndiri mewavimani. Shitwatira ashi shilanguziya paweru pakavitakulira vitiba vya Shiyawudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakashilembiti Luka ndo shintola shashilifana na vintora vya Matayu na Mariku, kwantambu ilii vintora avi vitakulira vitwatira viraa vilii muntambu yayilifana. Pa vintora vitatu, Luka ndo yakatakulira nakamu visoweru vya kwiyuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza. Luka katakulira kwa kugolokera kuusu ulekiziwu (Shipandi sha 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na viraa maluwa (Shipandi sha 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Luka kankulaviya ULONGOLERU wa Shisoweru Shiwagira shakuwi na kutakulira toziya ya kushilemba, shipandi sha 1:1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kankuvitakulira visoweru vya kuyiwuka kwa Yesu na ntambu yakatandiritwi kuusu utenderu, Shipandi sha 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Musemu nkulu yayisigariti mu Shisoweru Shiwagira, Shipandi sha 4:14 mpaka shipandi sha 21:38, Luka kankutakulira mahengu Yesu gakatenditi, shikulu nentu ndo mauzauza gakatenditi na vitwatira vyakafunditi.</para>
  <para style="io">Muvipandi viwili vya upeleru, Shipandi sha 22 mpaka shipandi sha 24, Luka kankutakulira kuusu Yesu ntambu yakahowiti na ntambu yakasilitwi na ntambu yakazyukiti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mtuwa Teufili.</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu wavua wajeriti kulemba vitwatira vyavitendikiti pakati pa twenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walembiti ntambu yawatugambiriti vilii vyawaviwoniti kwa masu gawu kwanjira pavyanjiti, na walii yawabweriti Shisoweru Shiwagira. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Su mkulu Teufili, toziya nuvigendiriti weri vitwatira vyoseri avi kwanjira pavyanjiti, mona ifaa na neni nukulemberi weri ntambu yayirawiriti. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ntenda hangu, su na gwenga gupati kuvimana nakaka toziya ya vitwatira avi vyanukufunditi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza kwankubwerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shipindi sha Herodi mfalumi gwa Yudeya, kuweriti na mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu litawu lyakuwi wamshema Zakariya, yakaweriti gwa shipinga sha watambika sha Abiya. Mdala gwakuwi litawu lyakuwi wamshema Elizabeti nayomberi kaweriti gwa shiyiwuku sha mtambika Aruni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na woseri wawili waweriti wantu wa matendu gaherepa kulongolu kwa Mlungu, walikala pawagajimira malagaliru goseri ga Mtuwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kumbiti weriti wahera nonu, toziya Elizabeti kaweriti mpendi, vinu woseri wawili waweriti wagogolu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Zakariya kaweriti kankutenda lihengu lyakuwi lya utambika Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, toziya shiweriti shipindi shakuwi sha kutambika. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kulawirana na vitiba vya watambika, Zakariya kasyagulitwi kwa kugalambuziya simbi kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu su katumiziyi ubani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shipindi Zakariya pakaweriti kankutumiziya ubani, lipinga lya wantu waweriti walivaga pamuhera kunja wankumluwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kamlawiriti Zakariya, kagolokiti uwega wa kumliwu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zakariya pakamwoniti, kalilimuka, kaweriti na lyoga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti, “Nagutira Zakariya! Mlungu kapikanira kala kuluwa kwaku. Mdala gwaku Elizabeti hakakuleleri mwana mpalu. Na mwana ayu litawu lyakuwi gumshemi Yohani. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yomberi hakaweri nemeru na nemeleru kwaku, wantu wavuwa hawaweri na nemeleru kwa kwiwuka kwakuwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yomberi hakaweri mkulu pamasu pa Mtuwa, hakalandi ndiri divayi ama ujimbi, yomberi hakamemi Rohu Mnanagala kwanjira mumtima mwa mawu gwakuwi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hakawatendi wantu wavuwa wa Israeli wamuwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yomberi hakamlongoleri Mtuwa, hakaweri na makakala pamuhera na uwezu ntambu yakaweriti Eliya mbuyi gwa Mlungu. Hakawajegi kayi pamuhera wana na watati, hakawawuziyi wantu yawamjimira ndiri Mlungu kuwera na maholu ga wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu na kumtandira Mtuwa wantu yawasyagulitwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Zakariya kamkosiya ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, “Hanuvimani hashi shisoweru ashi? Toziya neni pamuhera na mdala gwangu twawagogolu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamwankula, “Neni Gaburieli yangoloka kulongolu kwa Mlungu, ndo kantuma ntakuli na gwenga na kukugambira shisoweru ashi shiwagira. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vinu guloli! Toziya gujimira ndiri shisoweru shangu, ashi hashitendeki kwa shipindi shakuwi, vinu haguweri bubu, haguwezi ndiri kutakula mpaka lishaka lilii pashilawira shisoweru ashi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lipinga lya wantu liweriti lyankumuhepera Zakariya na walikangasha kwa kukawa kwakuwi mulii Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakalawiti kasinditi kutakula nawomberi, nayomberi kendereyiti kuwalanguziya kwa mawoku hera, nawomberi wavimaniti kuwera kawoniti shintu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pashiperiti kala shipindi shakuwi sha kutenda lihengu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kagenditi ukaya kwakuwi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pa mashaka galii mdala gwakuwi Elizabeti kawera na yinda, kalikaliti mnumba kwa myezi muhanu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>kalitakuliti, “Vinu Mtuwa kamonera lusungu kwa kumusilira soni zyangu kulongolu kwa wantu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwukwa kwa Yesu kwankubwerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yinda ya Elizabeti pasokiti myezi sita, Mlungu kamtumiti Gaburieli ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kagendi mpaka Galilaya, lushi lwa Nazareti. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kaweriti na shisoweru kwa muhinga bikira yakahetitwi na muntu yawamshema Yosefu, gwa shiyiwuku sha Dawudi, litawu lyakuwi ayu bikira ndo Mariya. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamwiziriti Mariya na kumulamusiya, “Gwakashina? Ponga iweri pamuhera na gwenga! Mtuwa kapamuhera na gwenga, kakupanana upendelewu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mariya kalisheliti nentu, toziya ya shisoweru sha ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, kaliholiti mumoyu pakalikosiya, “Kulamusiya aku kwana mana gaa?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti Mariya, “Nagutira Mariya, Mlungu kakupapanana manemu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Guloli, haguweri na yinda na kwiwula mwana mpalu na litawu lyakuwi hagumshemi Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ayu hakaweri mkulu, hawamshemi mwana gwa Mlungu na Mtuwa Mlungu hakampanani shibanta sha ufalumi sha Dawudi mbuyi gwakuwi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hakakolimlima lukolu lwa Yakobu mashaka goseri na ufalumi wakuwi hapeni uweri na upeleru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mariya kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, “Neni haneliwoni na mpalu! Hashiweri ashi shisoweru ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamuwankula, “Rohu Mnanagala hakizi kwaku na makakala ga Mlungu hagakwizili. Toziya ayi mwana hakiwukili hakaweri mnanagala, hakashemwi Mwana gwa Mlungu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Gumuholi mlongu gwaku Elizabeti, yomberi yawamshemiti mpendi kumbiti hakaleri mwana mpalu muugogolu wakuwi na mwezi agu ndo mwezi gwa sita kwa yinda yakuwi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Toziya kwahera shintu shashikamala kwa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mariya katakula, “Neni na ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa! Iweri kwa neni ntambu ya gulongiti.” Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawukiti na kugenda zakuwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mariya kankumtyangira Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mashaka galii Mariya kawukiti kagenditi mpaka isi ya mulugongu lwa Yudeya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Aku kingiriti mnumba mwa Zakariya na kamlamsiyiti Elizabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elizabeti pakapikaniriti ntambu Mariya yakamlamsiyiti, nonu kadunkula mumtima mwakuwi. Elizabeti kamemiti Rohu Mnanagala, <verse number="42" style="v"/>Elizabeti kalonga, “Gutekelerwa gwenga pakati pa wadala woseri na katekelerwi mwana hakiwukili mumtima mwaku. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Neni na gaa ata mawu gwa Mtuwa gwangu kanizili neni? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nakugambira, palaa pampikaniriti ntambu yagunamusiyiti, nonu kadunkula kwa kunemelera mumtima mwangu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mbaka gwenga toziya gujimira kuwera havitendeki vitwatira vyakakugambiriti Mtuwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mariya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Moyu gwangu gumkwisa Mtuwa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na rohu yangu yankunemelera,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya Mlungu ndo Mlopoziya gwangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Toziya kamonera lusungu neni ntumintumi gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwanjira vinu wantu woseri hawalongi Mlungu kantekelera,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Toziya ya shintu shikulu shakantendera Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q">Litawu lyakuwi linanagala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kawalanguziya lusungu lwakuwi</para>
  <para style="q">Kwa walii yawampanana ligoya kwa shiyiwuku na shiyiwuku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Katenda vitwatira vikulu kwa liwoku lyakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q">Kawapalasiya yawawera na msindu pamuhera na mipangu ya myoyu yawu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawasulusiya yawawera na likakala mu ukolamlima wawu,</para>
  <para style="q">Na kawakweniziya wananagala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yawawera na njala kawayikutiziya vintu viherepa,</para>
  <para style="q">Na walunda kawawusiya mawoku hera.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Katenda shakatakuliti kwa wambuyi wetu wagona,</para>
  <para style="q">Kiza kumtanga Israeli ntumintumi gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ntambu vyakawagambiriti wambuyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q">Aburahamu na wiwuka wakuwi mashaka goseri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mariya kalikaliti pamuhera na Elizabeti kwa shipindi sha myezi mitatu, shakapanu kawuyiti ukaya kwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Shipindi sha Elizabeti kwiwura shisokiti, kiwuliti mwana mpalu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Wantu wapakwegera wakuwi na walongu wakuwi pawapikaniriti visoweru viherepa vya kulikangasha Mtuwa vyakavitenditi kwa Elizabeti, womberi wanemeleriti pamuhera na yomberi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Palipititi lijuwa limu, womberi wiziti kumwingiziya jandu mwana, wafira kumpanana litawu lya tati gwakuwi, Zakariya. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Kumbiti mawu gwakuwi kalonga, “Hangu ndiri! Litawu lyakuwi hawamshemi Yohani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Wamgambira, “Kwehera muntu muwalongu waku yawamshema litawu ali!” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Wamlanguziyiti langaliru tati gwakuwi, wavimana ntambu hakamshemi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Zakariya kaluwiti shibawu na kalemba hangu, “Litawu lyakuwi ndo Yohani.” Kila muntu kalikangasha. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Pala palii Zakariya kanjiti kayi kutakula, kanjiti kumkwisa Mlungu. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Lyoga lyayingiriti woseri yawalikaliti pakwegera nayomberi na visoweru avi vyoseri vyeniyiti muisi yoseri ya mulugongu mwa Yudeya. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Woseri yawapikaniriti vitwatira avi, waliholiti mumyoyu mwawu pawalonga, “Mwana ayu hakaweri gwa ntambu gaa?.” Toziya nakaka makakala ga Mtuwa hagaweri pamuhera nayomberi.</para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa umbuyi lwa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Zakariya, tati gwa Yohani kamemiziwiti Rohu Mnanagala, katungiti shisoweru shiwagira sha Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Tumkwisi Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa Israeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Kiza kuwatanga wantu wakuwi na kuwakombola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Katupanana mlopoziya mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">Mushiyiwuku sha Dawudi ntumintumi gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Gambira ntambu yakawagambiriti</para>
  <para style="q">wambuyi wa Mlungu wananagala kwanjira kwanja.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Hakatulopoziyi kulawa mumawoku mwa wangondu wetu</para>
  <para style="q">na kutulaviya kulawa mumakakala mwa woseri yawatufira ndiri.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Kalongiti hakawawoneri lusungu wambuyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kulihola lipatanu lyakuwi linanagala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Kulirapa kwakamlapiriti Aburahamu mbuyi gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>kuwera hakatutangi twenga tulopoziwi kulawa kwa wangondu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q">Katugambira tumtenderi Mlungu pota na lyoga, <verse number="75" style="v"/>tuweri wananagala yatumfiriziya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q">mashaka goseri ga makaliru getu.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>“Na gwenga mwana gwangu, hawakushemi mbuyi gwa Mlungu kakumpindi nentu.</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya hagumlongoleri Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="q">kumnyawila njira yakuwi, <verse number="77" style="v"/>haguwagambiri wantu wakuwi kuwera hawalopoziwi</para>
  <para style="q">kwa kuwawusilira vidoda vyawu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Mlungu gwetu mnanagala na yakawera na lusungu.</para>
  <para style="q">Hakatulavilili gulangala gwa ulopoziya kulawa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>na kawalangazira woseri yawalikala muluwindu lwa kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q">na kuwalonguziya magulu getu munjira ya ponga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Mwana kendereyiti kukula nshimba na kuwera na makakala murohu. Kalikaliti kushiwala mpaka lishaka lya kuliranguziya mweni kwa wantu wa Israeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 1:18-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Majuwa galii, Kaisari Agustinu mfalumi gwa Rumi kabweriti kulagalira, wantu woseri wa Iushi loseri la Rumi wawalangwi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuwawalanga aku ndo kuweriti kwa kwanja shipindi Kureniu pakaweriti mkulu gwa mukowa gwa Siriya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Su kila muntu kagenditi kulembwa litawu lyakuwi muisi mwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Viraa Yosefu kaweriti na mwanja gwa kulawa Nazareti mumkowa gwa Galilaya, kagenditi muisi ya Betirehemu mumkowa gwa Yudeya pakayiwukiti Dawudi. Yosefu kagenditi kulii toziya kalawiti mushiyuwuku sha Dawudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kagenditi kulii wakalembwi pamuhera na Mariya muheta gwakuwi, yakaweriti na yinda. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pawaweriti kulii Betirehemu, shipindi sha Mariya sha kwiwura mwana shisokiti. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamwiwula mwana gwakuwi gwa kwanja mpalu, kamgubikila nguwu na wamgonjeka muliboma lya wang'ombi, toziya womberi wapatiti ndiri pakugonja kunumba ya wahenga.</para>
  <para style="s">Walolera wa mifugu na wantumintumi wa kumpindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuweriti na walolera wa mifugu, yawaweriti kuntundu pashiru wankulolera mifugu yawu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Walolera wa nkanyama wankulolera wakondolu wawu.</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kawalawariti walolera wa mifugu na ukwisa wa Mtuwa guwalangaziya. Womberi watiliti nentu, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawagambira, “Namtira! Neni nuwajegerani shisoweru shiwagira, shisoweru ashi hashiwajegeli wantu woseri wanemeleri nentu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Leru muisi ya Mfalumi Dawudi kiwuka Mlopoziya gwenu. Mweni ayu ndo Kristu Mtuwa! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ayi haliweri lilangaliru kwa mwenga, pamusoka kala palii hamumwoni nonu wamgubikira vinguwu vya shiwana wamgonjeka muliboma la wang'ombi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Palaa palii wantumintumi wamonga wa kumpindi wavuwa nentu, waliwoniti pamuhera wamkwisiti Mlungu, pawalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Ukwisa uweri kwa Mlungu kumpindi nentu,</para>
  <para style="q">na ponga iweri pasipanu kwa wantu yawamfira Mlungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wantumintumi wa kumpindi pawawukiti kala kuwuya kumpindi kwa Mlungu, walolera wa mifugu wanja kuligambira weni, “Vinu su tugendeni Betirehemu na kulola shintu shashitendikiti, shakatugambiriti Mtuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Su wawuka wagenda kanongola, pawasokiti palii wawawona Mariya na Yosefu na nonu ulii wamgonjeka muliboma la wang'ombi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Walolera wa mifugu pawamwoniti kala nonu ulii, su wanja kutakula ntambu yawapikaniriti kulawa kwa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kuusu nonu ayu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri yakapikaniriti hangu kashyeniti visoweru vyawatakuliti walolera wa mifugu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mariya kavituliti vintu vyoseri avi mumoyu mwakuwi na kavihola mana yakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Walolera wa mifugu wawuyiti pawayimba kwa kumkwisa Mlungu ntambu yawapikaniriti na yawawoniti, iwera ntambu iraa ilii yawapikaniriti kulawa kwa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumupanana litawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Palisokiti lishaka lya nani, shipindi sha kumwingiziya mwana jandu, wampananiti litawu Yesu, litawu lyeni ali ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamupananiti kala Mariya pakaweriti ndiri na yinda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamtula Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pashisokiti shipindi sha msambu gwa kupungwa kwawu Mariya na Yosefu hangu ndo ifiriwitwi mumalagaliru ga Musa, wamtola mwana wagenda nayu Yerusalemu wamtulili Mtuwa, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ntambu yayilembitwi mumalagaliru ga Mtuwa, “Kila mwana gwa kwanja mpalu kafiruwa kutulwa kaweri mnanagala kwa Mtuwa.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Viraa virii wagenditi su walaviyi tambiku ya wankunda wawili ama wana wawili wa teteli, ntambu yayifiruwitwi mulilagaliru ga Mtuwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shipindi shiraa shilii kuweriti na muntu yumu yawamshema Simoni yakalikaliti Yerusalemu. Kaweriti muntu kaherepa, muntu yakamfiriziya Mlungu na kaweriti kankulolera kulopoziwa kwa wantu wa Israeli. Rohu Mnanagala kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, <verse number="26" style="v"/>na Rohu Mnanagala kamgambiriti kala Simiyoni kulonga hapeni kahowi mpaka kamwoni Kristu yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Su Rohu Mnangala kamlonguziyiti Simiyoni kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Na palii mawu na tati gwa Yesu wamjegiti Yesu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu wamtenderi ntambu yayifiruwitwi mulilagaliru, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simiyoni kamwanka mwana mumawoku mwakuwi na kamkwisa Mlungu pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Vinu Mtuwa guweza kumlekeziya ntumintumi gwaku</para>
  <para style="q">kagendi kwa ponga, toziya gugatimiza galii gagulagaliriti.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Masu gangu gawona ulopoziya waku,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>wawutandiritwi palongolu pa wantu woseri.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ulangala hawuwalangaziyi njira wantu wawawera ndiri Wayawudi</para>
  <para style="q">na hawujegi ukwisa kwa wantu waku Israeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tati na mawu gwa mwana walikangashiti nentu ntambu yakatakuliti Simiyoni kuusu mwana gwawu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simoni kawatekelera, kamgambira Mariya mawu gwa Yesu, “Mwana ayu kasyagulitwi na Mlungu toziya ya kwagamira na kulopoziwa kwa wantu wavuwa Muisraeli. Nayomberi hakaweri lilangaliru kulawa kwa Mlungu kumbiti wantu wavuwa hawamtakuli vidoda, <verse number="35" style="v"/>na virii vyawalihola wantu mumyoyu mwawu ndo havimaniki. Na gwenga Mariya utama hawuweri gambira mgoha gwagusongoka, haguwusomi moyu gwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Palii kuweriti na mdala mbuyi gwa Mlungu, litawu lyakuwi Ana, mwana gwa Fanueli gwa likabila la Asheri. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shakapanu kasigaliti mkenja mpaka shipindi pakiwiti mgogolu gwa vinja malongu matatu na msheshi. Shipindi shoseri ashi kalikaliti Munumba nkulu ya Mlungu pakaleka kuliya na pakamluwa Mlungu pashiru na paliwala. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shipindi shila shilii, Ana kiziti na kulonga mayagashii Mlungu na katakuliti visoweru vya mwana kwa wantu woseri wawaweriti wankumuhepera Mlungu kwa kukombolwa kwa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Maliya na Yosefu pawatenditi kala vyoseri ntambu yanfiruwitwi mulilagaliru ga Mtuwa, su wawuyiti ukaya kwawu Nazareti muisi ya Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwana kakula kawera na makakala, su kawera na luhala na Mlungu kamtekelera.</para>
  <para style="s">Mntemba Yesu kamnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kila mvinja mawu na tati gwa Yesu wagendaga Yerusalemu mumsambu gwa Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti na vinja lilongu na miwili, wagenditi nayu mumsambu ntambu yayiweriti shitiba. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Paguperiti kala msambu gwa Pasaka, wanjiti mwanja gwa kuwuya ukaya, kumbiti Yesu kasigaliti kulaa Kuyerusalemu pota mawu na tati gwakuwi kuvimana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Womberi wavimana Yesu kapamuhera na wantu wa mwanja, wagendagenda lishaka lyoseri, shakapanu wanja kumsakula mwa walongu na waganja wawu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wamwona ndiri, su wawuyiti Yerusalemu pawamsakula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lishaka lya tatu wamwoniti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kalikaliti pamuhera na wafunda wa Mayawudi, kaweriti pakawapikinira na kuwakosiya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Woseri pawampikaniriti vyakatakula, waweriti wankulikangasha ntambu yakeniti mahala na ntambu yakankuliti kwa luhala. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mawu na tati gwakuwi pawamwoniti washeniti. Maliya, mawu gwakuwi, kamkosiya, “Mwana gwenga, ashi gututenda ntambu ayi? Neni na tati gwaku tuweriti twankulishera patukusakula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Ntambu gaa mwankunsakula? Muvimana ndiri handa nfiruwa nulikali mnumba mwa Tati gwangu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kumbiti tati na mawu gwakuwi wavimana ndiri vyakawankuliti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu pakawuyiti pamuhera na mawu na tati gwakuwi Kunazareti, kendereyiti kuwajimira. Mawu gwakuwi kendeleyiti kulihola mmoyu mwakuwi. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kendereyiti kukula munshimba pamuhera na luhala na kumfiliziya Mlungu pamuhera na wantu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatiza ntambu yakabweriti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 3:1-12; Mariku 1:1-8; Yohani 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mushinja sha lilongu na muhanu wa ukolamlima wa Kaisari Tiberiwu, Pontiwu Pilatu kaweriti mkolamlima gwa Yudeya, Herodi kaweriti mkolamlima gwa mkowa gwa Galilaya na Filipi mlongu gwakuwi kaweriti mkolamlima gwa mikowa ya Itureya na Trakuniti. Lusaniya kaweriti mkolamlima gwa Abileni, <verse number="2" style="v"/>na Anasi na Kayafa waweriti watambika wakulu, shipindi ashi shisoweru sha Mlungu shimwizira Yohani mwana gwa Zakariya kushiwala kulii. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Su Yohana kagenda pahala poseri papaweriti na lushemba Yoridani kaweriti kankubwera pakalonga, “Mleki vidoda vyamtenditi na mkabatizwi, su Mlungu hakawalekiziyi vidoda vyamtenditi.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ayi ndo yawalembiti mushintola sha mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Liziwu lya muntu lipikanika kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mumtenderi kala Mtuwa njira yakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q">mumnyawili weri njira zyakuwi!’”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“ ‘Kila shibokela hawashifintili,</para>
  <para style="q">Kila lugongu na shigongu hashipalaswi,</para>
  <para style="q">Paweriti padusunka hapanyoshwi,</para>
  <para style="q">Zinjira za vuluvulu hazinyawi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wantu woseri hawawuwoni ulopoziwu wa Mlungu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lipinga lya wantu liziti kwa Yohani su wabatizwi. Yomberi kawagambira, “Mwenga mwashiyiwuku sha wanjoka, kakugambirani gaa mtugi maya ga Mlungu gagiza? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mulanguziyi nakaka ntambu yamutenda handa mleka vidoda vyamtenditi. Namwanja kulonga, ‘Twenga Aburahamu ndo mbuyi gwetu!’ Nukugambirani nakaka, Mlungu tembera katendi ata mabuwi aga gaweri wana wa Aburahamu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Su vinu liwagu litulwa kala kudumula mishigira ya mitera, na kila mtera gwagulera ndiri mabwajubwaju gaherepa, hagudumulwi na kugwasila mumotu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wantu wamkosiyiti Yohana Mbatiza, “Su twenga tutendi hashi?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yomberi kawankula, “Yakana nguwu mbili kamupi kahera nguwu na yakana shiboga na yomberi katendi ntambu iraayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Watola kodi wiziti wabatizwi, wamkosiya, “Mfunda na twenga tutendi hashi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawagambira, “Namtola kodi nentu ya shiyasi shawatuliti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na wamanjagila wamkosiya, “Na twenga tutendi ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Su yomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mleki kuwapoka wantu vintu vyawu, ama kuwasitaka wantu pamuwapayira hera. Mjimili shibena mgongu shampata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wantu woseri waweriti wankulolera kwiza kwa Mlopoziya, waweriti wankulikosiya mumyoyu mwawu Yohani, ndo Kristu? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paliya Yohani kuwagambira woseri, “Neni nankubatiza kwa mashi, kumbiti kwana muntu kiza kana uwezu kuliku neni. Neni weza ndiri kuyopola lugoyi lwa kutawira shiyatu shakuwi. Mweni ayu hakakubatizani kwa Rohu Mnanagala na kwa motu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yomberi mumawoku mwakuwi kana luselu lwa kupetera, hakayijojiniri nganu na kuitula muluhanja lyakuwi, kumbiti hakatoli miwawi na kuipambira pamotu gwagutenda ndiri tiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa visoweru vivuwa Yohani kaweriti kankuwabwelera wantu visoweru viheri, kankuwagambira wantu waleki vidoda vyawatenda. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yohani kamkalipiriti Herodi yakaweriti mkola mlima gwa mukowa, toziya kaweriti kamupoka Herodiya yakaweriti mdala gwa mlongu gwakuwi na katenditi vintu vivuwa vidoda nentu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Su Herodi katenditi shidoda nentu kwa kamtatira Yohani mushibetubetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wambatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 3:13-17; Mariku 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wantu woseri pawawabatiziti kala, Yesu wambatiziti vilavi. Pakaweriti kankuluwa, kumpindi kuvuguka, <verse number="22" style="v"/>na Rohu Mnanagala kamsulukira kaweriti gambira mpongu mfanu gwa ngunda, liziwu lipikanika kulawa kumpindi palilonga, “Gwenga gwa mwana gwangu yanukufira. Gunhelepera”</para>
  <para style="s">Alu ndo lukolu lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu pakanjiti lihengu lyakuwi kaweriti na mivinja milongu mitatu. Su wantu wamaniti hangu, Yesu kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu na Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Heli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Heli kaweriti mwana gwa Matati na Matati yakaweriti mwana gwa Lawi, shakapanu kayi Lawi mwana gwa Maliki na Maliki kaweriti mwana gwa Yanayi kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Matatiya</para>
  <para style="q">na Matatiya kaweriti mwana gwa Amosi</para>
  <para style="q">Amosi kaweriti mwana gwa Nahumu</para>
  <para style="q">na Nahumu kaweriti mwana gwa Hesli</para>
  <para style="q">na Hesli kaweriti mwana gwa Nagayi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nagayi kaweriti mwana gwa Maati</para>
  <para style="q">na Maati kaweriti mwana gwa Matatiya</para>
  <para style="q">na Matatiya kaweriti mwana gwa Shemeni</para>
  <para style="q">na Shemeni kaweriti mwana gwa Yoseki</para>
  <para style="q">na Yoseki kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yohanani</para>
  <para style="q">na Yohanani kaweriti mwana gwa Resa</para>
  <para style="q">na Resa kaweriti mwana gwa Zerubabeli</para>
  <para style="q">na Zerubabeli kaweriti mwana gwa Sheatiyeli</para>
  <para style="q">na Sheatiyeli mwana gwa Neri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neri kaweriti mwana gwa Maliki</para>
  <para style="q">na Maliki mwana gwa Adi</para>
  <para style="q">na Adi kaweriti mwana gwa Kosamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Kosamu kaweriti mwana gwa Elimadamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Elimadamu kaweriti mwana gwa Eri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eri mwana gwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="q">na Yoshuwa kaweriti mwana gwa Eliazeri</para>
  <para style="q">Eliazeri kaweriti mwana gwa Yorimi</para>
  <para style="q">na Yorimi kaweriti mwana gwa Matati</para>
  <para style="q">na Matati kaweriti mwana gwa Lawi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lawi kaweriti mwana gwa Simiyoni</para>
  <para style="q">na Simoni kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">na Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="q">na Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Yonamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Yonamu kaweriti mwana gwa Eliyakimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eliyakumu kaweriti mwana gwa Melea</para>
  <para style="q">na Melea kaweriti mwana gwa Mena</para>
  <para style="q">na Mena kaweriti mwana gwa Matati</para>
  <para style="q">na Mataha kaweriti mwana gwa Natani</para>
  <para style="q">na Natani kaweriti mwana gwa Dawudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Dawudi kaweriti mwana gwa Yese</para>
  <para style="q">na Yese kaweriti mwana gwa Obedi</para>
  <para style="q">na Obedi kaweriti mwana gwa Boazi</para>
  <para style="q">na Boazi kaweriti mwana gwa Salimoni</para>
  <para style="q">na Salmoni kaweriti mwana gwa Nashoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nashoni kaweriti mwana gwa Aminadabu</para>
  <para style="q">na Aminadabu kaweriti mwana gwa Adimini</para>
  <para style="q">na Adimini kaweriti mwana gwa Arini</para>
  <para style="q">na Arini kaweriti mwana gwa Hesironi</para>
  <para style="q">na Hesroni kaweriti mwana gwa Peresi</para>
  <para style="q">na Peresi kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="q">na Yakobu kaweriti mwana gwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="q">na Isaka kaweriti mwana gwa Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Aburahamu kaweriti mwana gwa Tera</para>
  <para style="q">na Tera kaweriti mwana gwa Nahori.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nahori kaweriti mwana gwa Serugi</para>
  <para style="q">na Serugi kaweriti mwana gwa Reu</para>
  <para style="q">na Reu kaweriti mwana gwa Pelegi</para>
  <para style="q">na Pelegi kaweriti mwana gwa Eberi</para>
  <para style="q">na Eberi kaweriti mwana gwa Sala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Sala kaweriti mwana gwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="q">na Kaini kaweriti mwana gwa Arifakisadi</para>
  <para style="q">na Arifakisadi kaweriti mwana gwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="q">na Shemu kaweriti mwana gwa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="q">na Nuhu kaweriti mwana gwa Lameki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lameki kaweriti mwana gwa Matusala</para>
  <para style="q">na Matusala kaweriti mwana gwa Henoki</para>
  <para style="q">na Henoki kaweriti mwana gwa Yaredi</para>
  <para style="q">na Yaredi kaweriti mwana gwa Mahalaleli</para>
  <para style="q">na Mahalaleli kaweriti mwana gwa Kenani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kenani kaweriti mwana gwa Enosi</para>
  <para style="q">na Enosi kaweriti mwana gwa Seti</para>
  <para style="q">na Seti kaweriti mwana gwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Adamu kaweriti mwana gwa Mlungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kugeziwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 4:1-11; Mariku 1:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalawiriti mulishemba mwa Yoridani, pakamema makakala ga Rohu Mnanagala na Rohu Mnanagala kamlonguziyiti Yesu kugenda kushiwala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kushiwala kulii, Shetani kamjeriti Yesu mashaka malongu msheshi. Shipindi shoseri ashi Yesu hakeniliyi shintu, pagapititi kala mashaka aga Yesu kaweriti na njala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shetani kamgambiriti Yesu, “Handa gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, guligambiziyi libuwi ali liweri libumunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Galembwa, ‘Muntu hapeni kalikali kwa libumunda hera.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Palaa paliya Shetani kamlonguziyiti Yesu na kumkweniziya pahala pampindi na kumlanguziya ufalumi wa pasipanu poseri. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shetani kamgambiriti Yesu, “Hanukupi uwezu wa falumi zoseri na lunda zyakuwi mana wanupa neni vyoseri, panfira kumupa muntu yoseri, weza. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vyoseri avi haviweri lunda zyaku gwenga handa pagung'uwira neni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwankula, “Galembwa, ‘Gumguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku na kumtendera yomberi gweka yakuwi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shetani kamjega Yesu mpaka Yerusalemu, kamkweniziya Pashitwiku pa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, kamgambira, “Handa gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, guliyasi pasi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Toziya galembwa, ‘Mungu hakawagambiri wantumintumi wakuwi wa kumpindi wakuloleli weri. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kayi galembwa hawakutoli mumawoku mwawu pota na kulikwala ligulu lyaku mulibuwi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Galonga, ‘Nagumjera Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shetani pakamjeriti kala Yesu kwa kila njira kasinda, kamleka kwa shipindi na kagenda zakuwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanja lihengu lyakuwi Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 4:12-17; Mariku 1:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu pakawuyiti Galilaya, keweriti kamema likakala lya Rohu Mnanagala. Shisoweru shakuwi shieneyiti pahala poseri pakwegera. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nayomberi kawera pakawafunda wantu mnumba zawu za Mlungu, woseri wamkwisa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamlemiti Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:53-58; Mariku 6:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Su Yesu kagenditi Nazareti, pahala pakaleleritwi na lishaka lya kwoyera kingira munumba ya Mlungu ntambu yayiweriti shitiba shakuwi. Kagoloka kabetuli malembu mananagala kwa liziwu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kawanka shindola sha Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya, kashivugula na kuwona pahala pawalembiti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Rohu gwa Mtuwa kapamuhera na neni,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya kansyagula neni nuwajegeli shisoweru shiwagira kwa wahushu.</para>
  <para style="q">Kantuma nuwagambiziyi watatirwa kuvugulirwa kwawu</para>
  <para style="q">Na wanalwisi wapati kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q">Wantuma nuwalopoziyi woseri wonewa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na kushibwelera shipindi shilii shankwiza,</para>
  <para style="q">Mtuwa hakawalopoziyi wantu wakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu pakabetuliti kala, kashigubika shindola na kamupa ntumintumi, mweni kalivaga. Wantu woseri munumba ya Mlungu, wamjodolera masu, <verse number="21" style="v"/>su kanja kuwagambira, “Leru Lilembu Linanagala ali liwera nakaka pampikaniriti lyankubetulwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Woseri wafiliziwa nentu nayomberi, walikangashira visoweru viwagira vyakatakuliti. Walonga, “Hashi ayu mwana ndiri gwa Yosefu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yomberi kawagambira, “Nakaka hamung'ambiri visoweru avi, ‘Mganga guliponiziyi gamweni.’ Viraa hamtakuli, ‘Goseri gatupikiniriti gugatenditi Kafarinaumu, gugatendi panu pa pashijiji shaku.’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kendereya kutakula, “Nankuwagambirani nakaka, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamanikana ndiri mushijiji mwawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Munpikiniri weri, Nakaka kweniti na wadala wakenja wavuwa pa isi ya Israeli shipindi sha Eliya, vula ileka kutowa kwa mivinja mitatu na nusu, kweniti njala nkulu pa isi yoseri. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ata hangu, Eliya wamtumiti ndiri kwa muntu yoseri Muisiraeri, ira kwa mdala mkenja yakalikaliti Sarepati pa Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mushipindi sha Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kweniti wantu wavuwa muisi ya Israeli yawaweriti walwala ungumbula kumbiti kwahera muntu yoseri yakapungitwi kumbiti Naamani yakaweriti gwa isi ya Siriya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wantu woseri wawaweriti munumba ya Mlungu pawapikaniriti aga, wakalaliti nentu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wagoloka, wamlaviya Yesu kunja kushijiji shawanyawiti kulugongu. Wamkweniziya mpaka mlupeleru lwa lugongu su wamwasi pasi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kapena pakati pawu kagenda zyakuwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kana washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 1:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kagenditi mpaka Kafarinaumu Iushi lwa Galilaya, kaweriti kankuwafunda wantu mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Walikangashiti mafundu gakafunditi, toziya katakuliti kwa uwezu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mlaa munumba ya Mlungu kweniti na muntu kana shamshera, su kabotanga, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Wuyi! Gwanashishi na twenga, Yesu gwa Nazareti? Gwapanu, gwiza kutulaga? Nukumana gwenga gwa gaa, gwenga gwa Mjumbi yumu Mnanagala gwa Mlungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii pakalonga, “Gunyamali na gumlawi muntu ayu!” Su shamshera ulii kumgusiya pasi muntu ulii kulongolu kwawu na kamlawa pota na kumtenda shintu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wantu woseri walikangasha na walitakuziyana weni kwa weni, “Ashi shitwatila gaa? Mana kwa uwezu na makakala kawagambira washamshera walawi nawomberi walawa!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Visoweru vya Yesu viyeniyiti pahala poseri mumkowa guliya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:14-17; Mariku 1:29-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kalawiti munumba ya Mlungu na kagenditi ukaya kwa Simoni. Nahonga gwa Simoni kaweriti na nshimba ipyupa nentu, wamluwiti Yesu kamuponiziyi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kagenda na kagoloka pakwegera na yomberi, kakukalipira kupyupa kulii na kupyupa kumleka. Palaa mawu uliya kimuka kawatendera.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mushenji paguweriti gwankuzyeta, wantu woseri wawaweriti na walweli wawu wawajega kwa Yesu, nayomberi katula mawoku gakuwi kwa kila muntu na kuwaponiziya woseri. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Washamshera wawalawa wantu wavuwa, wabotanga pawalonga, “Gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu!” Kumbiti Yesu kawakaripira, kawalewelera nawatakula, mana wavimana kuwera mweni ndo Kristu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankubwera munumba za Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 1:35-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pamandawira shirawu yakuwi, Yesu kawukiti kagenda pahala pagweka. Wantu waweriti wankumsakula na pawamwoniti kala, wajeriti kumzyengeta nakawuka. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kumbiti yomberi kawagambira, “Nfiruwa kubwera visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu mulushi zimonga viraa, toziya ntenda shilii shakantumiti Mlungu.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Su kawera kankubwera munumba za Mlungu Muyudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwashema wantumini wa kwanja</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 4:18-22; Mariku 1:16-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu kagolokiti pampenku pa litanda lya Genezareti, aku wantu waweriti wankulibabanika wapikiniri visoweru vya Mlungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawoniti mitumbwi miwili mumpenku mwa litanda, walowa wa wasomba waweriti wawuka, wagenditi kuzigulula wavu zawu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kagenda kwingira mumtumbwi mwa Simoni na kamgambiriti kagusegeziyi mtumbwi gulii palongolu padidini mulitanda. Yesu kalivagiti mumtumbwi na kanjiti kulifunda lipinga lya wantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakamaliriti kala kutakula, kamgambira Simoni, “Gushimi mtumbwi kugenda kumashi gagenda, gwenga na wayagu mwakazidibisiyi zinyavu zyeni mlowi wasomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simoni kamwankula, “Mtuwa, twenga pashiru poseri tutenditi lihengu liraa ali kumbiti tupata ndiri wasomba. Toziya gwenga gutakula hangu, neni hanuzidibisiyi zinyavu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pawadibisiyiti kala zinyavu wamemiti wasomba wavuwa mpaka zinyavu zyanja kudegeka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wawashemiti wayawu yawaweriti mumtumbwi gumonga wizi wawatangi. Womberi wiza na wamemisiya wasomba mitumbwi yoseri miwili mpaka yanja kulidiba. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoni Peteru pakawoniti yagalawiriti, kasuntamalira palongolu pa Yesu pakalonga, “Guwuki palongolu pangu, Mtuwa! Toziya neni muntu yanwera na vidoda!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni na wayaguwi woseri walikangashiti pawawoniti ntambu yawapatiti wasomba wavuwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wayaguwi na Simon, ashina Yakobu na Yohani, wana wa Zebedayu nawomberi walikangasha. Yesu kamgambira Simoni, “Nagutila, kwanjira vinu haguweri mlowa wantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wasegeziyiti mitumbwi yawu pampenku palitanda, waleka kila shintu, wamfata Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya muntu kana ugumbula</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:1-4; Mariku 1:40-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Su Yesu pakaweriti mulushi, kuweriti na muntu yakana ugumbula. Pakamwoniti Yesu, kasuntama makukama kulongolu kwa Yesu kamluwa pakalonga, “Mtuwa pagufira gumweni, guweza gumpungi neni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kanyosha liwoku lyakuwi na kumshinkula pakalonga, “Neni nfira hangu, gupungwi!” Pala palii ugumbula umlekeziya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamsinga pakalonga, “Nagumgambira muntu yoseri, su gugendi gwakaliranguziyi kwa Mtambika mkulu, gulaviyi tambiku ntambu yakalagaliriti Musa kwa kupungwa kwaku su muntu yoseri kavimani kuwera gupona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Visoweru vya Yesu vyeniyiti nentu. Lipinga lya wantu limgendiriti kumpikinira na wamonga wafiliti waponiziwi malweli gawu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawukiti na kagenda pahala pagweka, kaweriti kankumluwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziyiti muntu yakalewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 9:1-8; Mariku 2:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankufunda, Mafalisayu wamu pamuhera na wafunda wa Malagaliru yawalivagiti palii weni walawiti mukila Iushi lwa Galilaya na Yudeya na kulawa Yerusalemu. Likakala lya Mtuwa liweriti kwa Yesu kwajili ya kuponiziya walweli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wantu wamu wiziti pawampapa mushitanda muntu yakalewelekiti, wajeriti kumwingiziya mnumba su wamtuli palongolu pa Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Toziya ya lipinga lya wantu, wasinditi kwingira nayomberi mnumba. Su wamkweniziya mlweri ulii pashitwiku, wadonola pampindi palitala, shakapanu wamseleziya mlweri ulii mushitanda mwakuwi mpaka pakati kulongolu kwa Yesu. Wantu wamsheshi wankumsulusiya mlweri kupitira palitala.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Wantu wamsheshi wankumsulusiya mlweri kupitira pashitwiku</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu pakawoniti njimiru yawu nkulu, kamgambiriti mlweri ulii, “Ganja gwangu, vidoda vyaku vilekiziwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu su wanja kulikosiya pawalonga, “Ayu muntu gaa, kamwigilanga Mlungu! Mlungu gweka yakuwi ndo kaweza kulekiziya vidoda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kavimaniti kala vyawaliholiti su kawakosiya, “Hashi, mulihola hangu mumyoyu mwenu? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shoshi shikamala ndiri, ‘Kulonga vidoda vyaku vilekiziwa,’ ama kutakula, ‘Gugoloki na gugendigendi?’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nfira muvimani, Mwana gwa Muntu kana uwezu pasipanu wa kulekiziya vidoda.” Su kamgambiriti muntu yakalewelekiti, “Nunkugambira, gugoloki na gutoli mkeka gwaku na gugendi ukaya kwaku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pala palii muntu ulii yakalewelekiti kagoloka kulongolu kwawu woseri, katola mkeka gwakuwi na kugendagenda na kagenditi ukaya pakamkwisa Mlungu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Woseri walikangasha nentu! Waweriti na lyoga, wamkwisiti Mlungu pawalonga, “Tulola mauzauza leru!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamshema Lawi,</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 9:9-13; Mariku 2:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shakapanu, Yesu kalawa kunja, kamwoniti yakatola kodi litawu lyakuwi Lawi, kalivaga muofisi mwakuwi. Yesu kamgambira, “Gunfati.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lawi kagoloka, kaleka kila shintu, kamfatiti yomberi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lawi kamtenderiti Yesu msambu mkulu nentu pakaya pakuwi, mngati mwa wahenga, waweriti watola kodi wavuwa pamuhera na wantu wamonga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mafalisayu wamu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, winginikiti kwa wafundwa wa Yesu pawalonga, “Iwera hashi mwega mliya shiboga na kulanda pamuhera na watola kodi na wantu yawawera na vidoda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Wantu wakomu walandaga ndiri mtera, kumbiti woseri yawalwala ndo walandaga mtera. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Niza ndiri kuwashema wantu waheri, kumbiti niza kuwashema wantu yawawera na vidoda waleki vidoda vyawatenda.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamkosiya kwajili ya kwoya kuliya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 9:14-17; Mariku 2:18-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wantu wamonga wamgambiriti Yesu, “Wafundwa wa Yohani Mbatiza, woyiti kuliya mala zivuwa na kumluwa Mlungu na wafundwa wa Mafalisayu watendaga hera hangu, kumbiti wafundwa waku wankuliya na kulanda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Hashi muweza kuwatenda wahenga wa mpalu gwa ndowa wafungi pawawera na mpalu gwa ndowa? Hapeni watendi hangu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Su lishaka halizi pawamtola mpalu gwa ndowa, womberi ndo hawoyi kuliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu viraa kawagambira kwa mfanu, “Kwahera muntu hakatoli shiraka sha nguwu yasyayi na kusonera munguwu ngona. Pakatenda hangu, su nguwu yasyayi hawayidegi, kayi shiraka sheni hapeni shilinganiri na nguwu ngona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwahera muntu yakalekera divayi yasyayi mumihaku ya lukuli migona, toziya divayi ya syayi hayipanti mihaku ya lukuli na divayi yeni hayitiki na mihaku ya lukuli hayidegeki. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mala zoseri, divayi yasyayi ilekerwa mumihaku ya lukuli yasyayi! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kwahera muntu yakafira kulanda divayi yasyayi pakalanditi kala divayi ngona, su katakula, ‘Divayi ngona ndo iherepa nentu.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kwajili ya lishaka lya koyera</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:1-8; Mariku 2:23-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu lya kwoyera Yesu kaweriti kankupita mumigunda ya nganu. Wafundwa wakuwi waweriti wankubena mikunguwi ya nganu, pawayisyoga mumawoku mwawu na kuziliya mbunji zya nganu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayu wamu wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi mtenda shintu sheni Lilagaliru lilewelera kutenda mulishaka lya kwoyera?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga hamwenibetuli ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi na wayaguwi shipindi pawaweriti na njala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yomberi kingiriti Mnumba ya Mlungu, katola mabumunda gawatuliti Mnumba ya Mlungu, kaliyiti na gamonga kawapananiti wayaguwi. Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaliyaga kumbiti watambika hera ndo waliyaga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kamaliriti kwa kuwagambira, “Mwana gwa Muntu ndo Mtuwa gwa lishaka lya kwoyera.”</para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kana liwoku lilewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:9-14; Mariku 3:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lishaka lyamonga lya kwoyera Yesu kingiriti mnumba ya Mlungu kufunda. Kuweriti na muntu mlaa yakaweriti na liwoku lya kumliwu lyalilewelekiti. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu wamu wasakuliti shisoweru sha kumsitaki Yesu, su waweriti wankumuhepelera waloli handa kamuponiziyi muntu mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti kala shawaliholiti, su kamgambiriti muntu yakeniti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti, “Gugoloki, gwizi panu palongolu.” Muntu ulii kimuka na kugoloka palii. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawagambira, “Nukukosiyani, Lilagaliru litujimira twenga kutenda shishi mulishaka lya kwoyera? Kuponiziya ama kulaga? Kugalopoziya makaliru ga muntu ama kugalaga?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kawaloliti wega zoseri, shakapanu Kamgambira muntu yakeniti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti, “Gunyoshi liwoku lyaku.” Yomberi kanyosha liwoku lyakuwi na liwera kayi likomu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Womberi wakalala, su wanja kulihola ntambu ya kumtenda Yesu vidoda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawasyagula wantumintumi lilongu na awili</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:1-4; Mariku 3:13-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shipindi shilii Yesu kagenda kulugongu kumluwa Mlungu, kalivagiti kulaa aku pashiru poseri pakamluwa Mlungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shilawu yakuwi kawashema wantumintumi wakuwi, pakati pawu kawasyagula lilongu na wawili kawashema wantumintumi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Awa ndo Simoni yawamupiti litawu lya Peteru na Andereya mlongu gwakuwi na Yakobu na Yohani na Filipu na Batolumayu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Matayu na Tomasi na Yakobu mwana gwa Alifayu na Simoni yawamshemiti Zeloti, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yuda mwana gwa Yakobu na Yuda Isikariyoti yakamgalambukiti Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufunda na kuwaponiziya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 4:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakasulukiti kulugongu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi, Yesu kagolokiti palushi, pakaweriti na wafundwa wakuwi wavuwa. Lipinga likulu lya wantu wawalivagiti palii, walawiti Muyudeya yoseri na Yerusalemu na mbwega ya Tiru na Sidoni, <verse number="18" style="v"/>wiziti kumpikinira na kuponiziwa malweli gawu. Woseri yawagaziwitwi na washamshera viraa wiziti na waponiziwitwi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wantu woseri wafiriti kumshinkula Yesu, makakala gamlawiti na kawaponiziya woseri.</para>
  <para style="s">Nemeleru na kutabika</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 5:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawagalambukira wafundwa wakuwi na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mnemeleri mwenga mwawahushu,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu hawuweri wenu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mnemeleri mwenga yamuwera na njala vinu,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya hamyukutiziwi!</para>
  <para style="q">Mnemeleri mwenga yamlira vinu,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya hamsekeleri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mnemeleri mwenga wantu pawawakalirani na kuwalema, kuwahigilanga na kuwapayirani madoda, goseri aga toziya ya Mwana gwa Muntu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shipindi pagalawila aga, mnemeleli pa mvina, toziya ya lijenjeri likulu lyawawatulirani kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Hangu ndo wambuyi wawu wawatenditi wambuyi wa Mlungu ntambu iraayi.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kumbiti shondi shondi mwenga mwawalunda vinu,</para>
  <para style="q">Toziya nemeleru yenu vinu ipera!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shondi shondi mwenga yamwikuta vinu,</para>
  <para style="q">Hamuweri na njala!</para>
  <para style="q">Shondi shondi mwenga yamseka vinu,</para>
  <para style="q">Hamlili na kudaya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Shondi shondi wantu woseri wankukuzyumani, hera hangu wagogolu wawu watakuliti ntambu iraayi kwa wambuyi wa mpayu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwafira wangondu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 5:38-48, 7:12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kumbiti nankuwagambirani mwenga mwamunpikanira. Muwafiri wangondu wenu, muwatekeleri woseri wakukalalirani. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muwatekeleri woseri wawakupangilirani na muwaluwili kwa Mlungu woseri yawakutenderani madoda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Muntu pakakukoma lisaya limu, gumleki kakomi na lisaya lyamonga, handa muntu pakakupoka likoti lyaku, gumlekeri na lishati lyaku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri pakakuluwa gumpanani na muntu pakakupoka ulunda waku, nagumgambira kawuziyi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Muwatenderi wamonga ntambu yamfira kutenderwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Handa pamuwafira walii yawawafira mwenga, hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda wawafira wantu yawawafira womberi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kayi pamuwatendera viheri walii yawakutenderani mwenga viheri, hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda watendaga hera hangu! <verse number="34" style="v"/>Na pamuwakopesha walii yamuwahola kuwera hawakuwuzireni hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda wawakopeshaga yawawera na vidoda, pawalihola wawawuziliri shawawakopeshiti. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kumbiti mwenga muwafiri wangondu wenu na muwatenderi viheri, mkopeshi namliholera kuwuzilirwa. Lifupu lyenu haliweri likulu na hamuweri wana wa Mlungu gwa kumpindi. Toziya yomberi ndo muheri kwa wantu yawahera mayagashii na yawatenda vidoda. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muweri na lusungu gambira Tati gwenu ntambu yakawera na lusungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatoza wamonga</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 7:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Namuwatoza wamonga, su Mlungu hakawatozi ndiri mwenga, namuwapangira wamonga, su Mlungu hapeni kawapangili mwenga, muwalekeziyi wamonga, su Mlungu hakawalekiziyi mwenga. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muwapanani wamonga, su Mlungu hakawapanani mwenga. Hamuwanki shipimu shakumemeziya, sha kutikisiya na kuyonera na kwitika mumawoku mwenu, vyoseri avi haviweri vya mwenga. Shipimu shamuwapimiliti wamonga, Mlungu ndo hakakupimirani mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu, “Muntu kana lwisi kaweza ndiri kumlongoziya kana lwisi muyaguwi, pakatenda hangu, woseri hawapokeri mulirindi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwahera mfundwa kaweza kumsinda mfunda gwakuwi, su kila mfundwa pakamalila kala mafundu hakaweri gambira mfunda gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Guweza hashi kushiwona shibandu shididini nentu mulisu lya mlongu gwaku, pota kuwona lipingiri lya mulisu lyaku? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hashi guweza kutakula kwa mlongu gwaku, ‘Guleki nukuwusiyi shibandu shididini nentu mulisu lyaku,’ na gwenga gusinda kuliwona lipingiri lya mulisu lyaku? Gwa mfyangu gwenga! Kwanja guwusiyi huti lipingiri lya ligogu mulisu lyaku, ndo haguwezi kushiwusiya weri shibandu mulisu lya mlongu gwaku.</para>
  <para style="s">Mtera na mabwajubwaju gakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 7:16-20, 12:33-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Kwahera mtera guherepa gwagulera mabwajubwaju gadoda, viraa mtera gudoda guweza ndiri kulera mabwajubwaju gaherepa. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kila mtera gumanika kulawirana na mabwajubwaju gakuwi galeriti, guweza ndiri kwapa embi mumishongoma ama zabibu mumbigiri. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Muntu muheri katendaga viheri kulawa muviheri vivuwa mumoyu mwakuwi, na muntu kana vidoda katendaga vidoda kulawa muvidoda vivuwa mumoyu mwakuwi. Toziya mlomu gutakula galii gaweriti mumoyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntambu mbili zya wanyawa numba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 7:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Iwera ashi munshema, ‘Mtuwa, Mtuwa,’ Uganu mtenda ndiri vyanuwagambirani? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hanuwalanguziyi ntambu yakalifana muntu yoseri pakiza kwa neni na kupikinira visoweru vyaneni na kuvijimira. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kalifana na muntu yakanyawa numba yakuwi, kabawa pasi nentu na kunyawa liyanjiru mulitalawu. Mafuriku gamashi pagarawiriti gayiputa numba ilii kumbiti itikinyika ndiri, toziya wayinyawiti weri numba. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Su yoseri ulii yakapikanira visoweru vyangu na kuvijimira ndiri, ayu kalifana na muntu yakanyawiti numba yakuwi pota na kunyawa lyanjiru, mafuriku pagiziti gayiputa numba ilii na kuguwa puu na kubomokanga nakamu!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya mtumini gwa Mkulu gwa Warumi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:5-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pakamaliriti kutakula vyoseri kwa wantu, kagenditi Kafarinaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mkulu gwa wanjagila miya yimu kaweriti na ntumini yakamfiriti nentu. Ntumintumi kaweriti kalwala tashitashi. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Mkulu gwa wanjagila miya wa Shirumi</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mkulu ulii pakapikaniriti visoweru vya Yesu, kawatumiti wazewi wa Shiyawudi kumluwa kizi kamuponiziyi ntumintumi gwakuwi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wagenditi kwa Yesu na kumuhiga nentu pawalonga, “Muntu ayu kafiruwa gumtenderi shitwatila ashi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kawafira wantu wetu na mweni katunyawira numba ya Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Su Yesu kagenda pamuhera na womberi. Pakaweriti pakwegera na ukaya kwa mkulu ulii, mkulu ulii kawatumiti waganja wakuwi wamgambiri Yesu, “Mtuwa naguligaziya hera. Gwenga gufiruwa ndiri kwingira mnumba mwangu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na neni mona nfaa ndiri ata kwiza kwa gwenga. Kumbiti gutakuli hera, ntumini gwangu hakaweri mkomu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mana neni viraa namuntu gwa pasi pa ukulu, nanawa wamanjagila yanuwalongoziyiti. Panumgambira yumu, ‘Gugendi!’ Yomberi kagenda na panumgambira yumonga, ‘Gwizi!’ Yomberi kiza na panumgambira ntumintumi gwangu, ‘Gutendi shintu ashi!’ Nayomberi katenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu pakapikaniriti hangu kalikangasha, su kaligalambukiriti lipinga lya wantu lyalimfatiti pakalonga, “Nankuwagambirani, mpata ndiri kuwona muntu kana njimiru gambira ayu Muisraeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wantu walii pawasokiti ukaya kwa Mkulu wamwoniti ntumintumi ulii kawera mkomu nakamu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamzukusiya mwana gwa Mkenja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shakapanu, Yesu kagenditi lushi lwawalushema Naini, wafundwa wakuwi pamuhera na lipinga likulu lya wantu wagenda nayomberi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Su pakaweriti pakwegera na mlyangu mkulu gwa Iushi, wantu wampapiti yakahowiti waweriti wankulawa kunja kwa Iushi. Yakahowiti kaweriti mwana gwagweka gwa mdala yakaweriti mkenja, na lipinga likulu lya wantu waweriti pamuhera nayomberi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mtuwa pakamwoniti mkenja ulii, kamwonera lusungu mdala ulii, kamgambiriti, “Nagulira.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shakapanu kalisegelera lijeneza lya yakahowiti na kulishinkula, wantu wawalipapiti wagoloka. Yesu kalonga, “Muntemba! Nukugambira gwimuki!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muntu ulii yakahowiti kalivaga, su kanja kuyowera. Yesu kamupa mawu gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wantu woseri weniti lyoga wamkwisiti Mlungu pawalonga, “Mbuyi mkulu kalawira pakati petu. Mlungu kiza kuwalopoziya wantu wakuwi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Visoweru avi vya Yesu viyeniyiti mulushi loseri lwa Yudeya na lushi zya pakwegera.</para>
  <para style="s">Wajumbi yakawatumiti Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 11:2-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wafundwa wa Yohani wamgambiriti Yohani vitwatira avi vyoseri, nayomberi pakawashemiti kala awili wamu wa wafundwa wakuwi <verse number="19" style="v"/>kawatumiti kwa Mtuwa wakamkosiyi, “Hashi, gwenga ndo gwamweni yatumuhepera, ama tumuheperi gwingi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wafundwa walii wamgendiriti Yesu na kumgambira, “Yohani Mbatiza katutuma kwaku tukukosiyi handa gwenga ndo uliya yakatakuliti gwankwiza ama tumuheperi gwingi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shipindi shiraa shilii Yesu kaweriti kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa weniti na malweri na wamonga waniti na washamshera wadoda na kuwapanana wanalwisi wavuwa kulola. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawankula wantumintumi wa Yohani pakalonga, “Mgendi mwakamgambiri Yohani vyoseri vyamuviwoniti na kuvipikinira, wanalwisi wawona, wavibyeketu wagendagenda, woseri walii yawawera na ungumbula wapungwa, yawawera na majogu vinu wapikinira, wahowiti su wazyuka na Shisoweru Shiwagira shibwerwa kwa wahushu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mbaka woseri walii wahera lyoga na neni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Su wajumbi wa Yohani pawawukiti kala, Yesu kanja kuligambira lipinga kwajili ya Yohani, “Pamgenditi kumlola Yohani kushiwala mfira kulola shintu gaa? Mfiriti kuwona gambira mateti ntambu yagatikinyika na lihega? Ndala! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Su mgenditi kumlola muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Hashi mliholiti Mgenditi kumlola muntu kavaliti nguwu ziherepa? Ndala, wantu yawavala nguwu ziherepa na kubojola vinoga noga vyaviwera muukulu! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Su mung'ambiri, mgenditi kumlola muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Mgenditi kumlola mbuyi gwa Mlungu? Yina nakaka, tuwona gavuwa nentu kuliku mbuyi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohani ayu ndo yumu yawamtakula mukulemba, kulonga, ‘Mlungu kalonga, hanumtumi mjumbi gwangu hakakulonguleri kukunyawira njira kwajili yaku.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamaliriti kwa kulonga, “Nukugambirani, Yohani ndo mkulu kuliku woseri yawalikaliti pasipanu. Kumbiti yakaweriti mdidini Muwufalumi wa Mlungu ndo mkulu kuliku Yohani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wantu woseri wampikaniriti. Wantu wavuwa asa watola kodi ndo wagajimiriti Malagaliru Mananagala ga Mlungu, awa ndo walii Yohani yakawabatiziti. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kumbiti Mafalisayu pamuhera na wafunda wa Malagaliru wagulemiti mpangu gwa Mlungu na wamlemiti Yohani kawabatizi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kongera kulonga, “Vinu wantu wa mashaka aga walifana na shintu gaa? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Walifana gambira wana yawalivaga pahala pa guliwu. Shipinga shimu shishigambizisiya shamonga, ‘Tuviniti msambu gwa ndowa kumbiti mwenga mvina ndiri! Twimba lwimbu lwa kudaya kumbiti mlila ndiri!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yohani Mbatiza pakiziti, koyiti kuliya na kalanda ndiri divayi, kumbiti mwenga mlongiti, ‘Kana washamshera!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kiziti Mwana gwa Muntu, kaliyiti shiboga na kulanda, kumbiti mwenga mtakula, ‘Mumloli muntu ayu, Kana lwaliya na mkologeru, ganja gwa watola kodi na wanavidoda!’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kumbiti luhala lwa Mlungu luwonekana kuwera lwa nakaka kwa wantu woseri yawalijimira.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuukaya mwa Simoni Mfarisayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mfalisayu yumu kamshemera Yesu walii shiboga sha pamihi pamuhera nayomberi na Yesu kingiriti mnumba mwa Mfarisayu na kulivaga pasi kuliya shiboga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Su palushi palii peniti na mdala yakaweriti na makaliru ga vidoda. Kapikaniriti handa Yesu kankuliya shiboga mnumba ya Falisayu, katoliti supa ya alabasta yayiweriti na utuli. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kagenda kagoloka pakwegera pamagulu pa Yesu pakalila na masozi gakuwi gamtulukiriti Yesu pamagulu. Kapukuta magulu ga Yesu kwa vilii zyakuwi na kunonera magulu, kagaswaga utuli. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mfalisayu pakawoniti hangu, kalitakuliti pakalihola mumoyu mwakuwi, “Handa muntu ayu nakaka ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu, hakavimani handa mdala yakakushinkula ka gaa, hakavimani makaliru ga vidoda ntambu yakawera nagu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira Mfarisayu uliya, “Simoni, nana shintu shakukugambira.”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni kamwankula, “Yina mfunda gung'ambiri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Kuweriti na wantu awili yawamkopiti muntu yakakopesha mpiya. Yumu kakopiti senti zivuwa na yumonga senti zivuwa ndiri. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pawasinditi kulipa uwanda wawu, muntu uliya kawalekiziya woseri awili. Vinu pakati pa wantu awili walii, yoshi hakamfiri nentu muntu ayu yakawalekiziyiti?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simoni kamwankula, “Nuvimana kuwera, ulii yawamlekiziyiti uwanda mkulu nentu”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamgambira, “Gutakula nweri.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kamgalambukira mdala uliya na kumgambira Simoni, “Gumwona mdala ayu? Niziti pakaya paku, gunupa ndiri mashi gakunaviya magulu gangu, kumbiti mdala ayu kaganaviya magulu gangu kwa masozi gakuwi na kumpukuta kwa vilii zyakuwi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gwenga gunamsiya ndiri kwa kunonera, kumbiti mdala ayu kwanjira paningiliti kaweriti pakanonera magulu gangu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Gwenga gunswagaziya ndiri lipaki mumtuwi mwangu, kumbiti mdala ayu kagapakaziya magulu gangu kwa utuli. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Su nukugambira, kwa kufira kwakuwi kukulu kulanguziyiti nakaka kuwera vidoda vivuwa vyakaweriti navyi vilekiziwa. Kumbiti ulii yakalekiziwa padidini kalanguziya kufira padidini hera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Su Yesu kamgambira mdala uliya, “Gulekiziwa vidoda vyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wantu wamonga yawaweriti walivaga pameza wanjiti kulitakuliziyana weni pawalonga, “Ayu gaa yakaweza kulekiziya vidoda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kamgambira mdala uliya, “Kujimira kwaku kukulopoziya, gugendi kwa ponga.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wadala yawagenditi pamuwera na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Shipindi shimonga Yesu kagenditi mwanja kupitila mlushi na muvijiji pakabwera Visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu. Wantumini lilongu na wawili wagenditi pamuhera nayomberi <verse number="2" style="v"/>na kuweriti na wadala wamu yawaponiziyitwi washamshera na malweli, Mariya yawamshemiti Magidalena, yawamuusiyiti washamshera saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yoana mweni mpalu gwakuwi Kuza yakaweriti mtenda lihengu mkulu gwa Herodi, viraa vilii kuweriti na Susana na wadala wamonga wavua watumiiti vyawaweriti navi kumtanga Yesu na wantumini wakuwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:1-9; Mariku 4:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wantu waweriti wankumwizira Yesu kulawa kila Iushi na pawaliwoniti pamuhera waweriti lipinga likulu, su yomberi kawagambiriti mfanu agu,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Mkweta mbeyu kagenditi kukweta mbeyu. Pakaweriti kankukweta mbeyu, mbeyu zimonga zitulukiti munjira na wagendagenda munjira wazitimbanga na wampongu waziliya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zimonga zitulukira mumabuwi ga mulitapaka na pazimeriti kala ziyanja kunyala toziya litapaka liweriti lya mashi ndiri. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Zimonga zitulukiriti mumisontu, pazimeriti, misontu ilii izibabanika na zisinda kukula. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na mbeyu zimonga zitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa, zimera na kulera viboga vivuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamaliriti kwa kutakula, “Yakana makutu kapikaniri!”</para>
  <para style="s">Shakafiriti kufunda mumifanu ayi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:10-17; Mariku 4:10-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiyiti Yesu mana ya mfanu agu, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nayomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mpananwa kuumana ubada wa Ufalumi wa Mlungu, kumbiti wamonga wavimana ndiri mpaka nuwagambiri kwa mifanu, su pawalola hapeni wawoni na pawapikanira hapeni wavimani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula mfanu gwa Mkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:18-23; Mariku 4:13-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mfanu agu ndo gutakula hangu, mbeyu ndo shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbeyu zilii zyazitulukiriti munjira mana yakuwi, woseri yawapikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu, kumbiti Shetani kiza na kushiwusiya shisoweru shilii mumyoyu mwawu, su hapeni wajimili na kulopoziwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mbeyu zyazitulukiriti mulibuwi mana yakuwi woseri yawapikanira ujumbi na kuuwanka kwa nemeru. Kumbiti wahera mishigira mitali, wajimira kwa shipindi shididini hera na shipindi sha kujerwa pashiza, waleka shawapikaniriti. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mbeyu zilii zyaziturukiriti mumisontu mana yakuwi, woseri yawapikaniriti shisoweru sha Mlungu, su lyoga na ulunda na vinoganoga vyawabojola hapeni waleri mabwajubwaju yagakamala. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na mbeyu zilii zyazitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa mana yakuwi, woseri yawashipikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu, pawashijimila kwa moyu gwoseri na gwa kujimira. Awa ndo wagangamala mpaka pawalera mabwajubwaju.”</para>
  <para style="s">Limuliku lyawaligubikiriti mulidebi</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 4:21-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Wantu hapeni wawashi limuliku na kuligubikira mulidebi ama walituli mulivungu mwa shitanda. Kumbiti hawalituli pampindi pashintambi su wantu pawingira mnumba wawoni kulangala ndaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Shoseri shawatenditi kwa kufifwa hashiwoneki na shoseri shawatenditi muluwindu hashimaniki na woseri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mlikali weri, ntambu yampikanira, toziya yakawera na shintu hawamwongeri, kumbiti ulii yakahera shintu ata shilii shakawera nashi hawampoki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mawu na walongu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:46-50; Mariku 3:31-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mawu gwa Yesu na walongu wakuwi wamgenderiti, kumbiti wasinda kumsegelera pakwegera toziya ya lipinga lya wantu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muntu yumu kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mawu na walongu waku wakunja, wafira wakuwoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiriti woseri, “Mawu na walongu wangu ndo woseri yawashipikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu na kushijimira.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulikalipira lyega</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:23-27; Mariku 4:35-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi wakweniti mumtumbwi na kawagambira, “Tuloki litanda, tugendi kumwambu.” Su wanja mwanja. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pawaweriti wankuloka, Yesu kaweriti na mpota su kagonja. Lyega likulu lyanja kuvuma, mashi ganja kwingira mumtumbwi, su wawera mukutenduwa, kubidukira mumashi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wantumini wamgendera Yesu na kumwimusiya, walonga, “Mtuwa, Mtuwa! Twankusokera!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kimuka, kalikalipira lyega pamuhera na mawimbi ga mashi, su vyoseri vyoya na kuweriti kuzindawala jiii. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kawagambira wantumini wakuwi, “Yakoshi njimiru yenu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kumbiti womberi walikangasha na kuwera na lyoga, waligambiziyana weni, “Ayu muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Kalikalipiriti lyega na mawimbi ga mashi na vyoseri vimjimira!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya muntu keniti washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:28-34; Mariku 5:1-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu na wantumintumi wakuwi wendereyiti na mwanja, wasoka kumpwani kwa isi ya Gerasi yapakwegera na Galilaya, kumwambu kulitanda. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu pakasulukiti kumpenku, kaliwoniti na muntu yakeniti washamshera, kamwizira kulawa mulushi. Kwa shipindi shivuwa muntu ayu kaweriti kagendagenda shivula na kalikala ndiri ukaya, kumbiti kalikaliti kumapumba. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pakamwoniti Yesu, kabotanga, kasuntama pamagulu ga Yesu pakalonga kwa liziwu likulu, “Yesu Mwana gwa Mlungu gwa Kumpindi nentu! Gufira kutenda ashi kwa neni? Shondi shondi nukuluwa naguntenda!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kalongiti hangu toziya Yesu kamgambiriti shamshera kamlawi. Shipindi shivuwa shamshera ulii kamwigilanga muntu ayu, tembera wantu wamtuliti mushibetubetu, mawoku na magulu gakuwi wagatawiti kwa minyololu kumbiti yomberi kayidumuliti na shamshera kamtugiziyiti kushiwala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamkosiya muntu uliya, “Litawa lyaku gwagani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yomberi kamwankula, “Litawu lyangu ‘Tuvuwa.’ ” Katakuriti hangu toziya kaweriti na washamshera wavuwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Washamshera wamluwiti Yesu nakawawinga kugenda mulirindi likulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Palii pawaweriti na lipinga likulu lya wamtumbi lya pakwegera, waweriti wakuliya mumpeku mwa mulugongu. Su washamshera wamluwiti Yesu kawajimiri wawayingiri wamtumbi, nayomberi kawajimira. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Washamshera wamlawiti muntu uliya na kugenda kuwayingira wamtumbi. Wamtumbi woseri watugiti pawaserera na kutulukira mumashi na wafuwiti woseri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Walolera wa mifugu walii pawawoniti galii yagalawiriti, watugiriti mulushi na muvijiji pawalonga shashilawiriti <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wantu wiza kulola shashilawiriti na pawaweriti wankumwizira Yesu, wamuwoniti muntu uliya yakeniti na washamshera kalikaliti pakwegera pamagulu ga Yesu, kaweriti kavaliti nguwu na kana mahala, su woseri waweriti na lyoga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Woseri yawaviwoniti vilii vyavilawiriti wawagambiriti wantu ntambu yakaponiti muntu ulii. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wantu woseri wenikaya wa lushi lwa Gerasi wamgambiriti Yesu kawuki, toziya waweriti na lyoga nentu. Su Yesu kakwena mumtumbwi na kuwuka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muntu yawamuusiyiti washamshera kamluwa Yesu pakamgambira, “Nfira kugenda na gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kumbiti Yesu kamjimira ndiri wagendi pamuhera, su kamgambiriti, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Guwuyi ukaya na katakuli shilii ntambu Mlungu shakakutendiriti.”</para>
  <para style="p">Su muntu uliya kagenditi kulushi na kutakula ntambu Yesu shakamtendiriti.</para>
  <para style="s">Nafunda gwa Yairu na mdala yakashinkuliti nguwu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 9:18-26; Mariku 5:21-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu pakawuyiti uwega umonga wa litanda, wantu wamshemiriti toziya waweriti wankumuhepelera. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pala kiza muntu yawamshema Yairu, kaweriti mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu. Kasuntama palongolu pa magulu ga Yesu na kumhiga pakamgambira wagendi ukaya kwakuwi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>toziya kaweriti na nafunda yumu hera, yakaweriti na mivinja lilongu na miwili su kaweriti kankulwala tashitashi.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu pakaweriti kankugendagenda, wantu wambabanika wega zoseri, <verse number="43" style="v"/>mngati mwawu kuweriti na mdala yakalwaliti kusuma mwazi mivinja lilongu na miwili, tembera katumiyiti ulunda wakuwi woseri kwa waganga kumbiti wamponiziya ndiri. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mdala ayu kamfwatiti Yesu kumbeli mulipinga lilii na kashinkuriti lusepi lwa nguwu ya Yesu, su palaa palii kusuma mwazi kwoya. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kakosiya, “Gaa kanshinkuliti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kila muntu kalemiti na Peteru katakuliti, “Mtuwa, lipinga lya wantu likutindiriti na kukubabanika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kalonga, “Nuvimana kwana muntu kanshinkula, mana nuvimana makakala ga kuponiziya gantawa.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mdala ulii pakawoniti kaweza ndiri kulififa, su kiza kwa kutetema na kusuntama palongolu pa magulu ga Yesu. Kaweriti kulongolu kwa kila muntu, kamgambiriti ntambu yakamshikuliti na ntambu yakaponiti kamkam hera. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira mdala ulii, “Nafunda gwangu, njimiru yaku ikuponiziya. Gugendi kwa ponga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera hangu, mjumbi kiza kulawa kunumba ya Yairu. Kamgambiriti Yairu, “Nafunda gwaku kahowa, nagumgaziya hera Mfunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu pakapikaniriti aga, kamgambira Yairu, “Nagwana lyoga, gujimiri hera hakaponi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pakasokiti pakaya, kabera muntu yoseri kwingira mnumba, ira Peteru na Yohani na Yakobu na tati na mawu gwa mwana yakahowiti. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kila muntu kaweriti kankulira na kudaya toziya ya nafunda ulii. Yesu kawagambira, “Namlira! Mwana kahowa ndiri ira kagonja hera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Wantu woseri wamseka, toziya wavimaniti mwana kahowiti. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kambata liwoku na kumshema, “Mwana gwangu gwimuki!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ukomu wakuwi umuwuyira, palaa palii kimuka, su Yesu kawagambiriti mawu na tati gwakuwi wamupi shintu shakuliya. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mawu na tati gwakuwi walikangashiti, kumbiti Yesu kawagambira nawamgambira muntu galii gagatendikiti.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatuma Wantumini lilongu na wawili</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:5-15; Mariku 6:7-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawashemiti wantumini lilongu na awili pamuhera na kuwayupa makakala na uwezu wa kuwalaviya washamshera woseri na kuponiziya malweri. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shakapanu kawatumiti wegendi wakabweri visoweru vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu na kuwaponiziya walweli, <verse number="3" style="v"/>kayi kawagambira, “Munjira mwamgenda namtola shintu shoseri, namtola lukongoshu ama muhaku, namtola shiboga ama mpiya, ama lishati lya shigibakiru. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Poseri pawawashemerani, mwikali mnumba ilii mpaka pamuwuka muisi ilii, <verse number="5" style="v"/>viraa vilii wantu pawalema kuwashemerani mwenga, mwuki mlushi alu na mpukuti lidika lya litapaka mumagulu mwenu haiweri likalipiru kwawomberi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Su wantumintumi wanja mwanja kugenda muvijiji vyoseri, pawabwera visoweru viwagila na kuwaponiziya wantu kila pahala.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupunganika kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 14:1-12; Mariku 6:14-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mtuwa Herodi mkolamlima gwa Galilaya, kapikaniriti goseri aga gagalawiriti, su gamupunganikiti nentu toziya wantu wamonga watakuliti kuwera Yohani Mbatiza kazyuka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wamonga watakuliti kuwera Eliya kalawira na wamonga walonga kuwera yumu gwa wambuyi wa makashu wa Mlungu kazyuka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Herodi kalonga, “Yohani numdumuliti mtuwi, muntu ayu yampikanira ndo gaa?” Su kendereyiti kumsakula Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuliyupa shiboga lipinga likulu lya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 14:13-21; Mariku 6:30-44; Yohani 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wantumintumi walii pawawuyiti, wamgambiriti Yesu vyoseri vyawatenditi. Yesu kawatola, wagenda gwekayawu lushi lwawalushema Betisayida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kumbiti lipinga lya wantu pawavimaniti kala aga, wamgenderiti. Yesu kawashemera na kayoweriti nawa visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu na kuwaponiziya woseri wawafiriti kuponiziwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mshenji paguweriti gwankuzyeta, wantumini lilongu na awili wamgenderiti na kulonga, “Guwagambiri wantu wagendi, kuvijiji na mumalambu ga pakwegera wakasakuli shiboga pamuwera na pahala pakugonja, toziya pahala panu patuwera pantundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga muwapanani shintu sha kuliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Womberi walonga, “Twana mabumunda mhanu na wasomba awili hera. Gufira twenga tugendi twakawahemeleri shiboga lipinga lya wantu woseri awa?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wapalu hera yawaweriti palii, waweriti gambira elufu muhanu hangu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Muwagambiri walivagi vipinga vipinga vya malongu muhanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Su wafundwa pawatenditi kala ntambu yakawagambiriti, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu katola mabumunda muhanu galii na wasomba awili, kaloliti kumpindi na kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kagamega kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi wawagawili wantu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wantu waliya mpaka wikuta na wantumintumi wasola majamanda lilongu na mawili ga vilii vyavisigaliti.</para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kulonga Yesu ndo Mlopoziya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 16:13-19; Mariku 8:27-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankuluwa Mlungu gweka yakuwi, wafundwa wakuwi wamwizira. Su Yesu kawakosiya, “Wantu walonga neni nagaa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Womberi wamwankula, “Wamonga walonga gwenga gwa Yohani Mbatiza na wamonga walonga gwenga gwa Eliya na wamonga walonga gwenga gwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu gwa makashu yakahowiti vinu kazyuka.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Su nayomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwenga mlonga neni nagaa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Peteru kamwankula, “Gwenga gwa Kristu Mlopoziya yagulagaliritwi na Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kawalagalira pakalonga nawamgambira muntu yoseri shisoweru ashi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga kutabika na kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 16:20-28; Mariku 8:30-9:1</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Mwana gwa Muntu mpaka katabiki na kulemwa na wazewi na watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa Malagaliru. Hawamlagi, kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti hakazyuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na kawagambira woseri, “Muntu yoseri pakafira kaweri na neni, mpaka kalilemi mweni, katoli lupingika lwakuwi mashaka goseri na kanfati. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri yakafira kugaponiziya makaliru gakuwi hakagamili na yoseri yakagamiziya ukomu wakuwi kwa kunfata neni hakagalopoziyi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hashi, kwana mbotu gaa muntu pakapata vintu vyoseri vya pasipanu, kumbiti mweni pakagamila? Yina ndiri! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Muntu pakamonera soni neni pamuhera na mafundu gangu, Mwana gwa Muntu hakamwoneri soni muntu ayu shipindi pakiza muukwisa wakuwi na ukwisa wa Tati na ukwisa wa wantumintumi wananagala wa kumpindi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nukugambirani nakaka, kwana wamonga palaa panu hapeni wahowi mpaka wauwoni Ufalumi wa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagalambuka nshimba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 17:1-8; Mariku 9:2-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Palipititi lijuwa kwanjira pakalongiti galiya, Yesu kawatoliti Peteru, na Yohani na Yakobu, kagenditi nawomberi mpaka kulugongu kuluwa Mlungu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakaweriti kankumluwa Mlungu, nshimba yakuwi igalambuka na nguwu zyakuwi ziwera neru mbuu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Palaa paliya wantu awili waweriti paliya wankuyowera nayomberi. Wantu walii waweriti Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>yawalawiriti muukwisa wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, waweriti wankuyowera na Yesu ntambu yakugumalilira mpangu gwa Mlungu gwa kuhowa kwakuwi kulii Yerusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Peteru na wayaguwi waweriti wankugonja, kumbiti wimukiti na kuwona ukwisa wa Yesu na wantu awili wagolokiti pamuhera nayomberi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Su wantu awili walii paweriti wankuwuka, Peteru kamgambira Yesu, “Mtuwa, iherepa twenga kulikala panu! Su hatunyawi visasa vitatu, shimu shaku na shamonga sha Musa na shamonga sha Eliya.” Nakaka kavimaniti ndiri shakatakula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Peteru pakatakuliti hangu, palaa paliya lilawira liwundi lizotopa liwagubika na liwundi ali paliwawiziriti wantumini walii weniti lyoga nentu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wapikinira liziwu kulawa muliwundi lilonga, “Ayu ndo mwana gwangu yanumsyaguliti, mumpikaniri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Liziwu lyawalipikiniriti palinyamaliti kala, wamwona kayi Yesu kagweka yakuwi. Wantumintumi pawaoniti hangu wanyamalira jii na shipindi shilii wamgambira ndiri muntu vilii vyawawoniti.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya Muntemba kana shamshera</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 17:14-18; Mariku 9:14-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shirawu yakuwi Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi watatu pawaweriti wankulawa kulugongu, lipinga likulu lya wantu waliwoniti na Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muntu yumu mulipinga lilii kabota pakalonga, “Mfunda! Nukuhiga gwakamloli mwana gwangu, mwana gwangu gwa gweka! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shamshera kamgaziyaga, pamonga kamtenda katendi umatu na pamonga kamtenda kaweri na shisirika na lifulufulu limlawa mumlomu. Kendereyiti kumgaziya nentu pota nakumlekeziya kanongola. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nuwaluwiti wafundwa wakuwi wamwusiyi shamshera kumbiti wasinda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga shiyiwuku shahera moyu na shana vidoda! Hashi hankali na mwenga na panuwahepelera mpaka ndii?” Shakapanu kamgambira muntu uliya, “Gumjegi mwana gwaku panu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mndemba ulii pakaweriti kankumgendera Yesu, shamshera uliya kamgusiya pasi, kumtenda shisirika. Kumbiti Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii, kamuponiziya mndemba, su kamupa tati gwakuwi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wantu woseri walikangashiti kwa uwezu mkulu wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuyowera kayi kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 17:22-23; Mariku 9:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu pawaweriti wankali wankulikangasha kila shintu shakatenditi Yesu, yomberi kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Namlyaluwa shanuwagambiriti! Mwana gwa Muntu hawambati mumawoku ga wantu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kumbiti wafundwa werewiti ndiri ntambu yakatakuliti. Shitwatira ashi shiweriti shififwa kwawomberi nawavimani, womberi watira kumkosiya ntambu yakatakuliti.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndo gaa yakaweriti mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 18:1-5; Mariku 9:33-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Palawiriti magambiziyanu pakati pawu wantumintumi walii, gaa yakaweriti mkulu nentu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu kavimaniti shawaliholiti, su kamtola mwana mdidini, kamgolosiya pakwegera na mweni, <verse number="48" style="v"/>na kawagambira, “Muntu yoseri ulii yakamshemera mwana mdidini ayu kwa litawu lyangu, kanshemera neni na yoseri yakanshemera neni, viraa kamshemera yumu ulii yakantumiti. Yoseri yakaweriti mdidini pakati penu ndo mkulu kuliku woseri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yakawalema ndiri mwenga ndo gwenu</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 9:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohani kankula, “Mtuwa, tumwoniti muntu pakawusiya washamshera kwa litawu lyaku na twenga tumubera, toziya kaweriti ndiri mushipinga shetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Namuwabera, toziya yoseri yakamlema ndiri yumu pakati penu, kawuwega wa twenga gwenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wasamaliya walema kumshemera Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Shipindi pashiweriti pakwegera sha Yesu mewamtoli kugenda kumpindi, yomberi kagonjera mwanja gwa Yerusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawatumiti wajumbi wamlongoleri na womberi wagenda mpaka mushijiji shimu sha Wasamariya, wamnyawili kila shintu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kumbiti wenikaya walema kumshemera toziya yomberi kaweriti kankugenda Yerusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Su wafundwa wakuwi, ashina Yohani na Yakobu, pawawoniti hangu walonga, “Mtuwa, gufira tugushemi motu kulawa kumpindi guwagamiziyi?” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu kawagalambukira na kawakalipira. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi mushijiji shimonga.</para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawafira kuwera wafwasi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 8:19-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Pawaweriti munjira wankugenda, muntu yumu kamgambira Yesu, “Hanukufati koseri kwagugenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Vibweta wawera na mpanga na wampongu wawera na vitukulu kumbiti Mwana gwa Muntu kahera pahala pa kwoyera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kamgambira muntu gwingi, “Gunfati.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kumbiti muntu ulii kalonga, “Mtuwa, gundeki huti nakamsiri tati gwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, “Guwaleki wahowiti wawasiri wayawu wawahowiti. Gwenga gugendi gwakawubweri ufalumi wa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Kuweriti na muntu gwingi yakamgambira Yesu, “Hanukufati Mtuwa, kumbiti gundeki huti ng'endi kuwaaga wantu wa ukaya kwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Muntu yoseri pakanja kulima, pakagalambuka na kulola kumbeli kafaa ndiri kutenda lihengu Muufalumi wa Mlungu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatuma malongu saba na awili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Shakapanu Mtuwa kawasyagula wamonga malongu saba na awili. Kawatuma wamlongoleri awili awili wagendi muvijiji vyoseri vyakafira kugenda yomberi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawagambira, “Viboga vya kubena vivuwa, kumbiti wantu wakubena wadidini. Su mumluwi mweni kana lirambu kajegi wantu wakubena mulirambu lyakuwi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vinu su mgendi, muvimani handa nankuwatuma mwenga gambira mwawakondolu wawagenda pakati pa wamaminyi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Namtola muhaku gwakutulila mpiya, ama libegi, ama vilwatu, namumlamsiya muntu yoseri munjira. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pamwingira mnumba yoseri, kwanja mtakuli hangu, ‘Ponga iweri mnumba amu!’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Handa pakaweriti yakafira ponga, ponga yamwenga hayikali nayomberi, handa ndiri, ponga yamwenga hayiwawuyili mwaweni. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwikali mnumba ayi pamliya na kulanda vyawakupanani, toziya yakatenda lihengu kafiruwa shibenamgongu shakuwi. Namgenda mala numba ayi ama yimonga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Handa pamsoka muisi na wantu pawawashemerani, mlii vyawakupani, <verse number="9" style="v"/>muwaponiziyi walweli muisi ilii na muwagambiri wantu, ‘Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera kwa mwenga.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kumbiti pamwingila muisi yoseri, wantu pawawalema kuwashemerani, muwuki na mlongi, <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Ata lidika lyalitulemeteriti mumagulu mwetu tulipunda na haliweri likalipiru. Kumbiti muvimani kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nakaka nukugambirani, lishaka lilii Isi ayi hayipati azabu nkulu kuliku ilii ya wantu wa Sodoma.</para>
  <para style="s">Shondi kwa Isi ijimira ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 11:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Shondi gwenga Kolazini! Shondi gwenga Betisayida! Handa mauzauza galawiriti kwa mwenga, megalawiri Tiru na Sidoni, wantu wakuwi mewavali nguwu zya maguniya shipindi shivuwa na kulivaga mulivu kuleka vidoda vyawatenda. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mlungu hakawapanani azabu nkulu nentu mulishaka lya kutoza kuliku Tiru na Sidoni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na gwenga Kafarinaumu, hagulikwisi mweni mpaka kumpindi kwa Mlungu? Hawakusulusiyi mpaka mulirindi lyalihera upeleru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, “Yakawapikanira mwenga kankumpikinira neni na yakawalema mwenga kanema neni, yakanema neni, ndo kamlema ulii yakantumiti.”</para>
  <para style="s">Walii malongu saba na awili wankuwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wantumini malongu saba na awili wawuyiti kwa manemu walonga, “Mtuwa, ata washamshera watujimila patuwakalipira kwa litawu lyaku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Numwoniti Shetani pakaguwiti gambira lupanda kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpikaniri! Nukupani uwezu wa kutimbanga wanjoka na vipinini na uwezu mkulu kwajili ya makakala goseri ga Shetani, kwahera shintu shakuwatenduwa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kumbiti namnemelera toziya washamshera wawajimila, ira mnemeleri toziya matawu genu wagalemba kumpindi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Manemu ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 11:25-27, 13:16-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shipindi shiraa shilii Yesu kanemeleriti kwa uwezu wa Rohu Mnanagala, kalonga, “Tati, Mtuwa gwa kumpindi na gwa paisi panu! Nonga mayagashii kwaku toziya guwalanguziya walii wahera mahala na guwafifa walii wanaluhala na wanamahala. Yina Tati, ntambu yagufiriti gumweni aga galawili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Tati gwangu kanupiti neni vintu vyoseri. Kwahera muntu yakammana Mwana ira Tati na kwahera yoseri yakammana Tati ira Mwana na yoseri yagagubutulitwi na Mwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kawagalambukira wafundwa wakuwi na kuwagambira, “Mbaka waviwona vilii vyamuviwona mwenga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nukugambirani mwenga kuwera wambuyi wa Mlungu na wafalumi wafiriti kugawona galii gamugawoniti mwenga, kumbiti wagawona ndiri na kupikinira ntambu yampikaniriti mwenga kumbiti wapikinira ndiri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Msamariya muheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mfunda gwa Malagaliru kiziti na kufira kumjera Yesu. Su kamkosiya, “Mfunda, ntendi ashi mpati ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, “Walemba shishi Mumalagaliru Mlungu gakampananiti Musa? Kupikanira ntambu yampikaniriti mwenga kumbiti wapikanira ndiri. Gwenga gugamana hashi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Muntu ulii kawankula, “Gumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku kwa moyu gwaku goseri na kwa rohu yaku yoseri na kwa makakala gaku goseri na kwa mahala gaku goseri na gumfiri muyagu ntambu yagulifira gumweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Guwankula weri, gutendi ntambu iraayi hagupati ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kumbiti mfunda gwa Malagaliru kafiriti kuliranguziya handa kahera vidoda, su kamkosiyiti Yesu, “Gwapakwegera gwangu ndo gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, “Kweniti na muntu yumu yakaweriti kankusuluka kulawa Yerusalemu, kaweriti kankugenda Yeriku. Pakaweriti munjira, wamvamiya wamajambazi wamkoma na kumpoka vintu vyakuwi wamleka kankugalagata nusula kahowi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shintu shashilawiti paliya, kweniti na mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu kaweriti kankupita njira ilailii, kumbiti pakamwoniti muntu yawamkomiti ulii, kapititi patali uwega wingi kagenda. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ntambu ilailii Mlawi kapititi njira ilailii, kumbiti pakamwonit muntu yawamkomiti ulii kapititi patali, uwega wingi su kagenda. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kumbiti Msamariya yakaweriti kankugenda mwanja kasokiti paliya pakaweriti muntu ulii na pakamwoniti muntu ulii, kamwonera lusungu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kamgendera, kampakaziya lipaki pamuhera na divayi muvironda vyakuwi na kumtawa, shakapanu kamkweniziya mupunda gwakuwi, kagenda nayu mpaka mnumba ya kugonja wahenga kamlwaziya. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shirawu yakuwi kalaviya mpiya mbili kumpanani kananumba ya kufikira wahenga na kamgambira, ‘Gumloleli weri muntu ayu na pampuya hanukulipi shoseri shagutumiyiti kwa muntu ayu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kamaliliti kulonga kwa kukosiya, “Ntambu yamlihola, pakati pa wantu watatu awa, ndo gaa kaweri kapakwegera gwa muntu yakakomitwi na majambazi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mfunda gwa Malagaliru kamwankula, “Uliya yakamwoniriti lusungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakatendi ntambu iraayi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawukaya kwa Marita na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi pawaweriti mumwanja, wingira mushijiji shimu waliwona na mdala yumu yawamshema Marita kamshemera ukaya kwakuwi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Marita kaweriti na muhasha gwakuwi yawamshema Mariya, yakalivagiti pakwegera pamagulu ga Yesu pakapikanira mafundu gakuwi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Marita kaweriti kankunyoganyoga na vimonga, su kamgenderiti Yesu na kumgambira, “Mtuwa, iwera hashi gumleka muhasha gwangu kandekeri neni nyoginyogi gweka yangu? Gumgambiri kizi, kantangi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mtuwa kamwankula, “Marita, Marita! Gwankunyoganyoga na kuligaziya na vintu vivuwa, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kumbiti shintu shimu hera shifiruwa. Mariya kasyangula shintu shiherepa nentu na kwahera muntu hakampoki.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufundiza ntambu ya kusali</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 6:9-13, 7:7-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti pahala tunga pakaluwa Mlungu. Pakamaliriti kuluwa Mlungu, yumu gwa wafundwa wakuwi kamgambira, “Mtuwa, gutufundi kuluwa Mlungu gambira Yohani Mbatiza ntambu yakawafunditi wafundwa wakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Pamluwa Mlungu mlongi hangu,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tati,</para>
  <para style="q">Litawu lyaku likwiswi,</para>
  <para style="q">Ufalumi waku wizi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gutupanani shiboga shetu sha kila lishaka <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gutulekiziyi vidoda vyetu,</para>
  <para style="q">Mana twenga tuwalekeziya woseri yawatutenditi upyota.</para>
  <para style="q">Pota nagututula mukujerwa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, “Payiwera yumu gwenu pakagenda ukaya kwa ganja gwakuwi pashiru na kumgambira, ‘Ganja, shondi shondi nyagu gunkopeshi mabumunda mitatu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ganja gwangu yakaweriti mumwanja, kapitira pakaya pangu na neni nahera shiboga shakumupa.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Na payiwera ganja gwaku kankuwankula kulawa mnumba, ‘Nagung'aziya! Mlyangu gutatwa kala, neni pamuhera na wana wangu tugonja kala. Na hapeni numuki kukupanani shintu shoseri.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nakaka nankuwagambirani, ata pakalema kwimuka na kukupanani mabumunda toziya gwenga gwa ganja gwakuwi, kumbiti pagwendereya kumgaziya kwa kumluwa hakimuki na kukupanana shoseri shagufira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Su nankuwagambira, guluwi na hampananwi, gusakuli na haguwoni, gutendi hodi na hamvugulirwi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mana woseri yawaluwa hawapananwi na woseri yawasakula, hawawoni na mlyangu haguvugulwi kwa kila muntu yakatenda hodi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwana pakamluwa tati gwakuwi somba, hashi hakampanani njoka badala ya somba? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na pakamluwa ligi, hakampanani shipinini? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Su payiwera mwenga yamuwera na vidoda, muvimana kuwapanana viherepa vyawaluwa wana wenu. Nakaka Tati gwenu gwakumpindi hakatendi kupita mwenga, hakawapanani Rohu Mnanagala walii yawamluwa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:22-30; Mariku 3:20-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kaweriti kankumwinga shamshera yakamtenditi muntu yumu kaweri bubu. Su shamshera ulii pakamlawiti, muntu ulii kaweziti kutakula. Lipinga lya wantu lilikangashiti, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kumbiti wantu wamu mulipinga lilii walonga, “Belizebuli, mkulu gwa washamshera ndo yakampananiti makakala ga kuwalaviya washamshera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamonga wafiriti kumjera Yesu, su wamgambira kawalanguziyi mauzauza kulonga nakaka Mlungu ndo yakamtumiti. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti kala shawalihola, su kawagambira, “Ufalumi woseri waubagulika weni vipinga vipinga vyavisingana vyeni hapeni vilikali, kaya payibagulika yeni mpaka iyagamili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Su handa ufalumi wa Shetani pawuwera muvipinga na pawalikoma weni, hawuendereyi hashi? Mlonga kuwera ndaviya washamshera toziya Belizebuli kanupiti makakala ga kutenda aga, <verse number="19" style="v"/>handa neni nankuwawusiya washamshera kwa likakala lya belizebuli, hashi wafata wenu wawawusiya kwa uwezu gaa? Wafata wenu hawaweri watoza wenu! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kumbiti payiwera nankuwinga washamshera kwa makakala ga Mlungu, su muvimani kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu usoka kala kwa mwenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Muntu kana makakala pakawera na silaha zoseri, pakalolera numba yakuwi mweni, vyoseri vyakaweriti navi haviweri salama. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kumbiti pakiza muntu kana makakala kuliku yomberi pakamkoma na kumsinda, hakatoli silaha zoseri zakalitumbiriti muntu ulii na kugawana ulunda wakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Yoseri yakawera ndiri uwega wa neni ndo nakaka kanema neni na yoseri yakajojinira ndiri pamuhera na neni, ayu ndo kapalasiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa shamshera</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Shamshera pakawingwa kulawa kwa muntu, kayerayera mlaa mushiwala pakasakula pakwoyera. Pakapata ndiri pakwoyera, kalitakuziya mweni, ‘Hambuyi kunumba kwangu kwandawiti.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakawuya na kwona numba ilii wayifyagira na kuyiherepiziya. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Su kagenda kuwatola washamshera wayaguwi wamonga saba wadoda kuliku yomberi, woseri wagenda kumwingira muntu ayu. Su ntambu ya muntu ayu hayiweri idoda kuliku ntambu yayiweriti kwanja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Manemu ga nakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti kankutakula hangu, mdala yumu kulawa mulipinga lya wantu kamgambira, “Mbaka mdala yakakuleriti na kukunoniziya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Mbaka nentu kwa walii yawapikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu na kushijimira”</para>
  <para style="s">Wafira Mawuzawuza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 12:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lipinga lya wantu palimzingiti Yesu, kendereyiti kutakula, “Shiyiwuku shikondola na shashihera uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mlungu! Mfira mauzauza, kumbiti hapeni mpananwi liuzauza lyoseri lilii ira hampananwi liwuzawuza lya Yona.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ntambu ira ilii Yona mbuyi gwa Mlungu pakaweriti lilangaliru kwa wantu wa Ninawi, su Mwana gwa Muntu hakaweri lilangaliru kwa wantu wa mashaka aga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Malikiya gwa kusika hakalawili shipindi shiyiwuku ashi pashitozwa na yomberi hakawatozi. Toziya mweni kagenditi mwanja kulawa kutali, kiziti kuvipikinira visoweru vya luhala lwa mfalumi Selemani, kumbiti panu kwana mkulu kuliku Selemani! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mulishaka lya kutoza, wantu wa Ninawi hawagoloki pamuhera na shiyiwuku ashi na womberi hawashitozi. Toziya wantu wa Ninawi walekiti vidoda vyawatenditi pawamupikaniriti Yona pakabwera, kumbiti panu kwana shitwatila shikulu kuliku Yona.</para>
  <para style="s">Gulangala gwa nshimba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 5:15, 6:22-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kwahera muntu yakawasha shikoroboyi na kushigubikira na mufiniku, ira hakashituli pashintambi, su wantu pawingira mnumba wapati kuwona kulangala. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Masu gaku ga gambira shikoloboyi sha nshimba. Masu gaku pagawera makomu, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri ilangala, kumbiti masu gaku pagawera gaherepa ndiri, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri muluwindu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Su gwikali weri, gulangala gwaguweriti mngati mwaku naguwera luwindu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Handa nshimba yaku yoseri paiwera ilangala, pota kuwera pahala poseri pa luwindu, nshimba ayi hayilangali nakaka gambira shikoloboyi ntambu yashikulangalira kwa gulangala wakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwakalipira Mafalisayu na Wafunda wa Malagaliru</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 23:1-36; Mariku 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu pakamaliriti kulonga, Mfalisayu yumu kamshemeriti ukaya kwakuwi waliyi shiboga pamuhera, su Yesu kagenditi na kulivaga kuliya shiboga. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mafalisayu walikangasha pawamwoniti kankuliya shiboga pota kugulula huti mawoku. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Su Mtuwa kamgambira, “Mwenga Mafalisayu mgulula vikombi na sahani kwa kunja kumbiti mngati mmema lwamata na vidoda. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwawazyigizyigi mwenga! Mlungu ndo yakanyawiti kunja, kayi kanyawiti mngati. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kumbiti muwayupi wahushu shilii shashiweriti muvikombi na musahani na kila shintu hashiweri shiherepa kwa mwenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Shondi mwenga Mafalisayu! Mwankumupa Mlungu zaka zya binzari na mshisha na mihamba yamonga na uganu pamlema yagamfiriziya Mlungu na ufiru wa Mlungu. Vitwatila avi mfiruwa muviloli weri pota na kulyaluwa vyamonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Shondi mwenga Mafalisayu! Mfira kulivaga palongolu pawapapanana ligoya munumba za Mlungu na kukulamsiyani kwa ligoya pahala pa soku. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Shondi mwenga! Toziya mulifana na mapumba yagalififa, wantu pawagendagenda kunani kwakuwi pota na kuvimana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yumu gwa Wafunda wa Malagaliru kamgambira, “Mfunda, pagutakuliti hangu, gutuhigilanga na twenga vilavi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, “Shondi mwenga wafunda wa Malagaliru! Muwatwika wantu visanka vipapika ndiri, kumbiti mwaweni mwenga muweza ndiri ata kwa shala kuwatanga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Shondi mwenga! Mganyawa mapumba gaherepa ga wambuyi wa Mlungu, weni wazewi wenu wawalagiti. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Su mgapitawulira na kugajimira galii gawatenditi wazewi wenu, wawalagiti wambuyi wa Mlungu, na mwenga mugajengera mapumba gawu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Toziya ayi Luhala lya Mlungu lutakuliti hangu, ‘Hanuwajegeri wambuyi wa Mlungu na wantumintumi, kumbiti hawawalagi wambuyi wa Mlungu wamu na kuwatabisiya wamonga.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Su wantu wa shipindi ashi hawatozwi kwa kuwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu kwanjira pawanyawiti pasipanu, <verse number="51" style="v"/>kwanjira pawamlagiti Abeli mpaka Zakariya ulii yawamlagiti pakati pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, pahala Pananagala. Yina, nakuwagambira, wantu wa shipindi ashi hawatozwi kwa matendu gawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Shondi mwenga wafunda wa Malagaliru! Muufifa ufunguu ulii wa mlyangu gwa mahala na mwaweni mwenga hapeni mwingiri na muwalewelera woseri yawafira kwingira nawingira.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Pakaweriti kankuwuka palii, wafunda wa Malagaliru pamuhera na Mafalisayu wanjiti kumgambira pawambeziya nentu na kumkosiya kwajili ya vintu vivuwa, <verse number="54" style="v"/>pawajera kumgomiziya pakatakula shintu shipayira su wapati pakumbatira.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Likapiru kwajili ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:26-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Maelufu ga wantu pawaliwoniti pamuhera, ata waweriti wankulitimbanga, Yesu kawagambiriti huti wafundwa wakuwi, “Mliloleri weri na simika ya Mafalisayu, nana mana ufyangu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila shintu shawashigubikiti hashiweri paweru na kila bada hayimaniki. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Su vyoseri vyamtakuliti muluwindu havipikaniki paluwala, ata vilii vyamulipwepwera shipindi pamtatiti milyangu havibwerwi panani pa numba.</para>
  <para style="s">Mweni yakafiruwa kumtira</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nukugambirani waganja wangu, namuwatira woseri yawalaga nshimba kumbiti wasinda kutenda shintu shimonga nentu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hanuwalanguziyani gwa kumtira, mumtiri Mlungu, ayu pakawalaga kala kana uwezu wa kumwasira muntu mumotu gwa Jehanamu. Munjimiri, ayu ndo yumu gwa kumtira!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Iwera ndiri washomolu wamuhanu wawawuza kwa senti ndikandika mbili? Kumbiti Mlungu hapeni kamuwaluwi shomolu ata yumu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ata vilii zya mumtuwi mwenu waziwalangiti kala. Su namtira, mwenga wa mana nentu kuliku washomolu wavuwa!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumjimira ama kumlema Kristu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:32-33, 12:32, 10:19-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nankuwagambira nakaka, kila muntu yakatakula kulongolu kwa wantu kulonga ndo gwaneni, Mwana gwa Muntu hakatakuli kulongolu kwa wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu kuwera muntu ayu ndo gwakuwi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kumbiti woseri yawanema kulongolu kwa wantu, Mwana gwa muntu viraa hakawalemi kulongolu kwa wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Na yoseri Yakamtakulira visoweru vidoda mwana gwa Muntu hakalekiziwi, kumbiti yoseri yakamwigilanga Rohu Mnanagala hapeni kalekeziwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Pawawabata na kuwajega munumba za Mlungu, ama kwa wakulu na wakolamlima, namulihola hola ntambu yakutakula ama ntambu ya kujiteteya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Toziya Rohu Mnanagala shipindi shiraa shilii hakawafundi ntambu yakutakula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mlunda mzyigizyigi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muntu yumu mulipinga lya wantu kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mfunda, gumgambiri mlongu gwangu tugawani uhala yakatulekeleriti tati gwetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, “Ganja gwangu, gaa yakantyeka neni weri mtoza gwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Su kawagambira woseri, “Muweri masu na muliloli weri na ntambu zoseri za matamata, toziya makaliru ganakaka ga muntu galitumbira ndiri vintu vivuwa vyakawera navi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu, “Kuweriti na mlunda yumu yakaweriti na lirambu lyakuwi lyalileriti viboga nentu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kanjiti kulihola mumoyu mwakuwi pakalonga, ‘Nahera pahala pa kutula viboga vyangu vyoseri. Su hantendi hashi?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kaligambiriti mweni, ‘Hantendi hangu, hambomoli hanja zyangu zoseri na kunyawa nkulu nentu, su hantuli viboga vyangu na lunda zyangu zimonga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shakapanu hanuligambiri mweni, Muntu yakana bahati! Gwana vintu vivuwa viherepa vya kuliya vinja ivuwa. Guvibojoli, vinu su gulii, gulandi na gulinemiziyi gumweni!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kumbiti Mlungu kamgambira, ‘mzyigizyigi gwenga! Leru pashiru rohu yaku hayitolwi. Vinu gaa hakatoli vintu vyoseri vyaguvituliti kwajili yaku gumweni?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na Yesu kamaliriti pakatakula, “Ayi ndo ntambu hayiweri kwa muntu ulii yakalitulira ulunda kwajili yakuwi mweni kumbiti hapeni kaweri mlunda kwa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Gumjimiri ula Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 6:25-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira wafundwa, “Nankuwagambira mleki kulihola hola makaliru genu ama nguwu zya kuvala. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ukomu wa mana nentu kuliku shiboga na nshimba yana mana nentu kuliku nguwu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mloli wampongu, wayala ndiri ama wabenanga ndiri, kayi wahera ata luhanja lwa kutulila viboga, kumbiti Mlungu kawapanana shiboga! Mwenga muwera na mana nentu kuliku wampongu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwana muntu yoseri pakati penu yakaweza kwongera mweni makaliru gakuwi ata kwa saa yimu? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Handa pamuweza ndiri ata kutenda shintu shididini, iwera hashi mulihola hola vintu vimonga? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Muloli mawuwa ga kuntundu ntambu yagakula, gatenda ndiri lihengu ama galinyawa ndiri geni. Kumbiti nukugambirani kuwera Mfalumi Selemani pamuhera na ulunda wakuwi woseri kapatiti ndiri kuvalisiwa gambira mawuwa aga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Payiwera Mlungu kaluvalusiya luhamba lya kuisi, lweni leru luwera na shirawu walwasila pamotu, ashi ndiri hakawatenderi nentu mwenga? Mwenga yamuwera na njimiru ndidini!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Su namuligaziya kwa kusaluka shintu sha kuliya ama shintu sha kulanda. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Toziya wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu pasipanu wavisakula nentu vintu vyoseri avi. Tati gwenu kavimana mfira vintu avi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kumbiti msakuli huti Ufalumi wa Mlungu na hakawapanani vintu avi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulunda kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 6:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mwenga shipinga shididini namtira, toziya Tati gwenu kafira kuwapanana Ufalumi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muwuzi vyoseri vyamuwera navi na muwapanani mpiya wahushu. Mulinyawili mihaku yayidegeka ndiri na mtuli ulunda wenu kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kweni aku hapeni ipungulwi toziya kwahera mpoka yakaweza kwiwa, ama wameyi yawaweza kuhalibisiya. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ulunda waku pawuwera, ndo na moyu gwaku haguweri.</para>
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi walikali weri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Muweri kala kwa kila shintu shashiza na muviwashi vikoloboyi vyenu, <verse number="36" style="v"/>gambira wantumintumi yawamuhepera mtuwa gwawu yakiza kulawa mumsambu gwa ndowa. Pakawera kankwiza na kutenda hodi, su hawamvugulili mlyangu kamukamu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mbaka kwa walii wantumintumi, mtuwa gwawu pakiza hakawawoni wankali masu! Nukugambirani nakaka, hakavuli nguwu yakuwi, nakuwagambira walivagi pasi na kuwatendera. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hawaweri na manemu ga ntambu gaa handa pakawawona wankali masu, ata pakiza pashiru ama pamandawira! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Muvimani nakaka kuwera handa mweni kana numba pakavimaniti shipindi shakwiza mpoka, hapeni kamleki mpoka kubomolanga numba yakuwi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Na mwenga viraa, muweri kala, toziya Mwana gwa Muntu hakizi shipindi shamumana ndiri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi waminika na waminika ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:45-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Peteru kamgambira, “Mtuwa, mfanu agu ndo kwajili ya twenga, ama kwajili ya kila muntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mtuwa kawankula, “Ndo gaa yakawera ntumintumi kaaminika na yakana mahala? Ndo ulii mtuwa gwakuwi yakamtula kaweri mlolera gwa numba na kuwapanana wantumintumi wamonga wa mtuwa gwakuwi kwa shipindi shifaa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mbaka yakuwi ntumintumi ulii, mtuwa gwakuwi pakawuya hakamwoni pakatenda hangu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nakaka nukugambirani, mtuwa hakampanani ukulu gwa vintu vyakuwi vyoseri. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kumbiti handa ntumintumi pakalitakulila mweni mumoyu, kuwera mtuwa gwakuwi kakawa shipindi shivuwa nentu kwiza, su kanja kuwakomanga wantumintumi wamonga, woseri wapalu pamuhera na wadala, su kalanda na kuliya shiboga pamuhera na kulanda ujimbi, <verse number="46" style="v"/>shakapanu mtuwa gwakuwi ntumintumi ulii hakizi lishaka na shipindi shakashimana ndiri. Mtuwa hakamdumuli vipandi vipandi na kumwasira kunja na kumtula mushipinga shimuhera na yawajimira ndiri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Ntumintumi yakavimana shakafira mtuwa gwakuwi kutenda, kumbiti kawera ndiri kala kutenda, hawamkomi nentu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kumbiti ntumintumi yakavimana ndiri shilii shakafira mtuwa gwakuwi, na viraa katenda shilii shimtenda wamkomi, hawamkomi padidika. Yawampananiti vivuwa hawamdayi vivuwa, kumbiti yawampananiti vivuwa nentu hawamdayi vintu vivuwa nentu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo shanjiru sha wantu kupalanganyiya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Niza kukoziya motu pasipanu, hera hangu meguweri gwakiti kala! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nana ubatizu weni nfiruwa nuwanki na ntabika nentu mpaka ukamiliki. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mulihola niza kujega ponga pasipanu? Ndala, kumbiti niza kupalanganyiya. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kwanjira vinu na kwendeleya kaya ya wantu wamuhanu hawapalanganyiki na wantu watatu hawalisingani kwa wantu wawili na wantu wawili hawalisingani kwa wantu watatu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Watati hawalisingani na wana wawu na wana hawalisingani na watati na wamawu hawawalemi wahinga wawu na wahinga hawawalemi wamawu na wanahonga hawawalemi wamika mwana na wamika mwana hawawalemi wanahonga wawu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kushimana shipindi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 16:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu viraa kawagambiriti wantu, “Pamuwona liwundi lilawira kushana, mala mlonga hakatowi na nakaka vula itowa. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pamuwona lihemuhemu lya kusika lyankuvuma, mlonga hakuweri na mshenji na nakaka iwera. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mwawafyangu mwenga! Muvimana kutunga lishaka ntambu yaliwera kwa kulola isi na liyera, kumbiti kwa ntambu gaa muvimana ndiri mana ya shipindi ashi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Gukoli mawoku na mngondu gwaku</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 5:25-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Ntambu gaa msinda kuamuwa maweni kutenda shitwatira shiheri? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Handa mstaki gwaku kankukujega pashizyungu, iherepa nentu mulikoli mawoku pamuwera mwankali munjira. Pamutenda ndiri hangu, nakakujega kwa mtoza mweni hakakujegi kwa wamanjagila na womberi hawakutuli mushibetubetu. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nakaka nukugambira hapeni gulawi mulii mpaka gulipi ata ligwala lya kumalalira.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mleki vidoda ama hamuhowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Shipindi shilii wantu wamu yawaweriti palii wamgambiriti Yesu kwajili wantu wa Galilaya weni Pilatu kawalagiti pawaweriti wankulaviya tambiku kwa Mlungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawakosiya, “Toziya wantu wa Galilaya wawalagiti kwa njira ilii, mlihola kuwera waweriti na vidoda kuliku wantu wa Galilaya wamonga? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neni nonga, ndala! Nukugambirani kuwera handa pamlema kuleka vidoda vyamtenda, hamhowi ntambu yawahowiti womberi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ntambu gaa kwajili ya wantu lilongu na wanani wa Silowamu yawahowiti shipindi mnara paguwatulukiriti? Mlihola kuwera womberi waweriti wanavidoda kuliku wantu wamonga wawalikala Yerusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ndala! Nukugambirani mwenga, handa pamlema kuleka vidoda vyamtenda, hamhowi ntambu yawahowiti womberi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mtini wagulera ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawagambiriti mfanu agu, “Kuweriti na muntu yumu, keniti na mtera gwa tini mulirambu lyakuwi. Kagenditi kwapa tini mumtera kumbiti kapata ndiri. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Su kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwa lirambu, ‘Guloli, kwa mivinja mitatu paniza kwapa mabwajubwaju mumtera gwa tini, kumbiti nugawona ndiri. Gugudumuli! Toziya gumalira hera litapaka.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kumbiti ntumintumi kamgambira, ‘Mtuwa, guguleki huti kwa shinja shimu hera, hanugulimili na kugulekera mbotu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pagulera mabwajubwaju shinja shankwiza, hayiherepi nentu, kumbiti pagulera ndiri su guweza kugudumula.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya mdala yumu mulishaka lya koyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kaweriti munumba ya Mlungu mulishaka lya kwoyera pakafunda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Palii peniti na mdala yakeniti na shamshera yakamtenda kalwali mivinja lilongu na nane, kaweriti na shibyongu ata kasinditi kugoloka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu pakamwoniti kamshema, “Mawu, su guponiziwa ulweli waku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kamtulila mawoku gakuwi, na palaa palii shibyongu shihuka na kawera safi, su kamkwisiti Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu kaweriti kakalala Yesu pakamponiziyiti mulishaka lya kwoyera, su kawagambiriti wantu, “Kwana mashaka sita gamuweza kutenda lihengu, mwizi mumashaka aga muponiziwi malweli genu, namwiza Mulishaka lya kwoyera!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mtuwa kamwankula, “Gwamfyangu gwenga! Ndo gaa pakati penu mekamvuguli ng'ombi ama punda gwakuwi kulawa mulizizi na kumtenda kalandi mashi ata payiwera lishaka lya kwoyera? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vinu su peni panu kwana muhinga gwa Aburahamu ndomweni Shetani kamtenda shibyongu kwa mivinja lilongu na nane, su iherepa ndiri kumponiziya mulishaka lya kwoyera?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuwankula kwakuwi kuwatenditi wadoda wawoni soni weni, kumbiti wantu wamonga wanemeleriti toziya ya vitwatira vyakatenditi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mbeyu ndidini nentu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:31-32; Mariku 4:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kakosiyiti, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu ulifana na shishi? Nuufaniziyi na shintu gaa? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ulifana hangu. Muntu katola mbeyu ndidini nentu ya haradali na kuyala mulirambu. Mbeyu imera na kuwera mtera, na wampongu wiza na kunyawa vitukulu vyawu mumitambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa simika</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 13:33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu kakosiya, “Hanuufaniziyi Ufalumi wa Mlungu na shintu gaa? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ulifana na simika yakatoliti mawu yumu na kuyihanganyiya pamuhera na ubumu vipimu vitatu, su ubumu woseri ututumuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangu mdidini</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 7:13-14,21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kendereyiti na mwanja gwakuwi kugenda muisi na muvijiji, pakafunda wantu na pakanyawa njira yakuwi kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Muntu yumu su kamkosiya, “Mtuwa, wantu hawawalopoziyi ndo wadidini hera?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawagambiriti, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mkamaliri nentu kwingira mumlyangu mdidini, toziya wantu wavuwa hawajeli nakaka kwingira kumbiti hapeni wingiri. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mkulu gwa numba hakimuki na kutata mlyangu, mwenga hamgoloki kunja na kwanja kukota mlyangu na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, mtuwa! Gutuvuguliri mlyangu!’ Nayomberi hakawankuli, ‘Nuwamana ndiri mwenga na pamlawa!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Su mwenga hamwankuli, ‘Tuliya na kulanda pamuwera na gwenga, na gwenga gutufunditi muisi yetu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kumbiti yomberi kayi hakalongi, ‘Nupamana ndiri pamlawa. Muwuki kulawa kwaneni mwoseri mtenda vidoda!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Su panu hamulili na kugayagaya menu genu pawakwasirani kunja na hamuwaloli Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobu na wambuyi wa Mlungu Muufalumi wa Mlungu! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wantu hawizi kulawa kwagulawa mushenji na kwaguzyeta mushenji, kulawa kushana na kusika, su hawaweri mumsambu Muufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Su woseri yawawera wa upeleru hawaweri wa kwanja, na woseri yawawera vinu wa kwanja hawaweri wa upeleru.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ufiru wa Yesu kwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 23:37-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shipindi shilaa shiliya Wamafalisayu wamu wamwiziriti Yesu na kumgambira, “Gufiruwa guwuki panu na gugendi pahala pingi, toziya Herodi kafira kakulagi gwenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Mgendi mwakamgambiri shibweta ulii hangu, ‘Nankuwalaviya washamshera na kuwaponiziya walweli leru na shilawu, na lishaka lya tatu hamalili lihengu lyangu.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vila vilii mpaka nweri mumwanja leru, na shilawu, na lishaka limonga, toziya iherepa ndiri kwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu wamlagi kunja kwa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yerusalemu! Shondi shondi Yerusalemu bamu! Guwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu, guwagumanga kwa mabuwi walii yawatumitwi kwaku! Vipindi vivuwa nfira kuwatula wana waku mumawoku mwangu gambira nkuku pakavigupika vyana vyakuwi kwa mbapatiru zyakuwi, kumbiti gwenga gunema! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Su hawakulekeli gumweni numba yaku. Nukugambira nakaka gwenga hapeni muwoni mpaka shipindi shiza pamtakula, ‘Mlungu gumtekeleri ulii yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziyiti muntu yakalwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu lya kwoyera, Yesu kagenditi kuliya shiboga kwa yumu gwa walongoziya wa Mafalisayu, na wantu wawaweriti palii waweriti wankumlola handa hakatendi shishi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Muntu mweni magulu na mawoku gakuwi gatutuma, kamwiziliti Yesu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na Yesu kawakosiyiti wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, “Hashi, Lilagaliru lya twenga lituruusu kuponiziya mulishaka lya kwoyera?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kumbiti womberi watakula ndiri shintu. Yesu kamshinkula muntu ulii na kumponiziya na kamleka kagendi zyakuwi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Su kawagambira, “Kwana muntu yoseri pakati penu yakawera na mwana ama ng'ombi yakapatukiliti mulirindi mulishaka lya kwoyera su hapeni kamlaviyi toziya ya lishaka lya kwoyera?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Woseri wasinda shakutakula, su wanyamalira jii.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukalamuka na Unanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kaloliti wahenga wamu ntambu yawasyagula pahala paherepa nentu, su kawagambira woseri mfanu agu, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Muntu yoseri pakakushemerani mumsambu gwa arusi, namlivaga pahala paherepa nentu. Mana pamonga kwana muntu yakawera mkulu kuliku gwenga wamshemera, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na ulii mwenikaya kakugambili, ‘Gumlekeli shiti ayu.’ Su palii haguwoni soni na hagugendi kulivaga pahala pa upeleru. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ira pagushemelwa, gugendi na kulivaga pahala pa upeleru, su mweni kaya gwaku hakizi kwaku na kukugambira, ‘Ganja gwangu, gwizi uganu, pahala paherepa ng'anji.’ Palii hagupananwi ligoya palongolu pa wahenga wamonga woseri. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa woseri yawalikweniziya hawawasulusiyi, na woseri yawalisulusiya weni hawawakweniziyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kumgambira na ulii yakamshemera, “Handa pagutenda msambu paliwala ama pashiru naguwashemera waganja waku ama walongu waku ama wapakwegera waku, toziya hawakushemeri na gwenga vira, na kwanjira ayi hagupati shilii shagutenditi kwawu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gwenga pagutenda msambu, guwashemeli wahushu, na wavibyeketu, na wana lwisi, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na hagutekelelwi, toziya hapeni wakulipi shilii shagutenditi kwawu. Mlungu hakakulipi gwenga mulishaka lya wantu waheri pawazyuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Msambu Mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 22:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumu gwa wantu yawalivagiti kulongolu kwa meza kapikaniriti aga, kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mbaka woseri hawawalivagi mumsambu Muufalumi wa Mlungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Kwana muntu yumu yakatenditi msambu mkulu na kawashemiriti wantu wavuwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Payiweriti shipindi sha msambu, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuwi wagendi wakawagambiri walii yawashemiritwi, ‘Wizi, toziya kila shintu shiwera kala!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kumbiti wantu woseri, yumu pa yumonga wanjiti kulonga toziya ya kuleka kwiza. Muntu gwa kwanja kamgambiriti ntumintumi, ‘Hemeriti lirambu su nfiruwa ng'endi nukaliloli, su nduwa hapeni nizi.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Muntu gwingi katakula, ‘Hemeriti wang'ombi lilongu limu na nankugolokera kugenda kuwajera mulirambu, su nduwa hapeni nizi!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na yumonga katakula, ‘Neni nyuga mdala, su hapeni nizi.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Su ntumintumi kawuya na kumgambira goseri mtuwa gwakuwi. Mtuwa ulii kakalaliti nentu na kumgambira ntumintumi gwakuwi, ‘kanongola gugendi munjira na muvipenyu vya muisi, gwakawajegi wahushu, na wavibyeketu na wanalwisi wavibyeketu wamonga.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pamberi ntumintumi kalonga, ‘Mtuwa, vitwatira vitendeka ntambu yagutakuliti, kumbiti mwana fasi mnumba.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Su mtuwa kamgambiriti ntumintumi, ‘Gugendi munjira na muvipenyu, guwagambiri wantu mpaka wizi, su numba yangu hayimemi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nukugambira nakaka kwahera muntu ata yumu pakati pa walii yawawashemeriti hakalambiti ata tyee shiboga shaneni!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Galama ya kuwera ntumintumi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 10:37-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Palii lipinga likulu paliweriti lyankugenda pamuwera na Yesu, yomberi kagalambuka na kuwagambira, <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Woseri yawiza kwa neni uganu wawafira tati na mawu wawu, wadala na wana, walongu na wadada wawu, ama womberi, hapeni waweri wafundwa waneni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Woseri yawatola ndiri lupingika lwawu weni na kunfata hapeni waweri wafundwa wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Handa yumu pakati pa mwenga yakafira kunyawa mnara, kwanja kalivaga huti pasi na kulihola galama zakuwi, pakalola handa kana mpiya zitosha za kumalira lihengu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Handa gwahera mpiya, pagunyawiti liyanjiru hapeni guwezi kumalira kunyawa mnara, na woseri pawalola galii gagalawiriti hawakuseki. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Womberi hawalongi, ‘Muntu ayu yakanjiti kunyawa mnara kasinda kumalira lihengu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Mfalumi yakawera na wantu elufu lilongu limu pakagenda kumkoma mfalumi yumonga yakawera na wantu elufu malongu mawili, mpaka huti yomberi kalivagi kulihola handa kana makakala ga kuukoma ufalumi umonga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Handa pakahera makakala, hakawatumi wajumbi waliwoni na mfalumi yumonga, kumkosiya mashaliti ga ponga uganu yomberi kankali ka kutali.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kamaliriti kwa kutakula, “Ntambu ira ayi kwahera ata yumu pakati penu hakaweri mfundwa wangu mpaka huti guleki kila shintu shakaweriti nashi.</para>
  <para style="s">Munu gunoga ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 5:13; Mariku 9:50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Munu guherepa, kumbiti munu pagukola ndiri kwahera njira ya kugutenda gukoli kayi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Su gufaa ndiri ata pawitira mulitapaka ama kuwera mbotu, hawagwasi kutali. Yakana makutu kapikaniri!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa kondolu yakagamiriti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 18:12-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu watoza kodi wavua pamuwera na wanavidoda wiziti kumpikinira Yesu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wamafalisayu na wafunda wa Malagaliru wanjiti kung'ong'a, mumoyu mwawu, walonga, “Muntu ayu kuwashemera wanavidoda na ata kuliya pamuwera na womberi!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Yumu pakati penu pakawera na wakondolu miya na pagwerewa yumu kagamila, hagutendi ashi? Haguwaleki walii wakondolu malongu tisa na tisa kuntundu na kugenda kumsakula kondolu ulii yakagamiliti mpaka gumwoni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pagumwona hagunemeleli nentu na hagumpapi mumakombi mwaku <verse number="6" style="v"/>na kuuya nayu ukaya. Shakapanu pagusoka ukaya, haguwashemi waganja waku na wapakwegera pamuwera na kuwagambira, ‘Nana shereku shereku nentu toziya numwona kondolu gwangu yakagamiliti. Su tunemeleli pamuwera!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ndo ntambu ira ayi, nukugambirani haiweri nemeru nentu kumpindi kwa yakatenda vidoda yumu pakaleka vidoda vyakatenditi kuliku wantu malongu tisa na tisa yawamfiriziya Mlungu, ndoweni yawalihola wahera vidoda vyakuleka.</para>
  <para style="s">Mpiya yaiyagamiliti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ama payiwera mdala yumu yakawera na magwala lilongu limu na ligwala limu paliyagamila, su hakatendi ashi? Hakawashi shikoloboyi, hakafyagili numba yakuwi na kusakula weri kila pahala mpaka kaliwoni. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Handa pakayiwona kala, ndo hakawashemi waganja wakuwi na wapakwegera pamuwera na kuwagambira, ‘Nana nemeli nentu toziya mona mpiya yaiyagamiliti. Su tunemeleli pamuwera!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nankuwagambira nakaka ndo hera hangu, wantumintumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu hawanemeleri toziya ya muntu yumu yakatenda vidoda pakaleka vidoda vyakatenditi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana yakagamiriti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kendereyiti kulonga, “Kwanaga muntu yumu yakaweriti na wana wawili wapalu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Muhasha kamgambiriti tati gwakuwi, ‘Tati gunupi vinu uhala wangu.’ Su muntu ulii kawagawira sawa wana wakuwi awili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gapita ndiri mashaka gavuwa muhasha ulii kawuza uhala wakuwi woseri, shakapanu kawuka ukaya kagenda zakuwi na mpiya zakapatiti. Kagenditi isi ya kutali kweni aku su katumiyiti mpiya zilii vuluvulu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kamaliriti kila shintu shakaweriti nashi. Su ilawira njala na kueneya muisi yoseri, na yomberi kaweriti kahera shintu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Su kagenditi kutenda lihengu kwa muntu yumu gwa isi ilii, mweni kamtuliti mulirambu lyakuwi kuwalolera wamtumbi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kafiriti kuliya viboga vyawalekiti wamtumbi, toziya kwahera muntu yakamupiti shintu shakuliya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Upeleru kanjiti kulihola mumoyu na kutakula, ‘Wantumintumi wa tati gwangu waliya viboga mpaka waleka, pahala panu neni nankufuwa njala! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hambuyi kwa tati gwangu na kulonga, Tati, ntenda vitendu vifaa ndiri kwa Mlungu na kwaku viraa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neni nfaa ndiri kushemwa mwana gwaku, guntendi neni gambira yumu gwa wantumintumi waku.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Su kanjiti mwanja kuwuya ukaya kwa tati gwakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">“Pakaweriti kankali kakutali kulawa ukaya, kumbiti tati gwakuwi kamwoniti kala, su moyu gwakuwi gumwoniliti lusungu, su kumtugira na kamkisikira mwana gwakuwi na kumnonera. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana ulii kamgambira tati gwakuwi, ‘Tati, neni numkosera Mlungu na gwenga viraa. Nfaa ndiri kunshema namwana gwaku.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kumbiti tati gwakuwi kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi na kawagambira, ‘Kanongola! Mtoli nguwu ziherepa nentu mumvalisiyi na pete mvalisiyi mushyala na mumvalisiyi vilwatu mumagulu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shakapanu mgendi mkamlikatuli ndama kaherepa tuliyi, na tunemeleli mumsambu! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Toziya mwana gwangu kahowiti, kumbiti vinu kazyuka, kaweriti kagamila, kumbiti leru kawoneka.’ Su wanjiti kuvina msambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Shipindi shilii mkulu gwakuwi kaweriti kankali keniwuyi kulirambu. Pakaweriti munjira pakwegera na ukaya kwakuwi kankuwuya, kapikaniriti zilaa shereku na ng'oma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Su kamshemiti yumu gwa wantumitumi na kamkosiya, ‘Kwana shishi pakaya panu?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ntumintumi ulii kamwankula, ‘Mlongu gwaku kawuya pakaya panu, su tati gwaku kamshinjira lindama likulukulu, toziya kamwona kankali mkomu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Su muntemba mkulu ulii kakalariti nentu, kalemiti kwingira mnumba, su tati gwakuwi kalawiti kunja na kamgambira kingiri. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kumbiti yomberi kamwankula tati gwakuwi, ‘Guloli, mivinja yoseri ayi nukutendera lihengu gambira ntumintumi, na ng'enda ndiri shinyumi na lilagaliru lyaku. Gunupa shishi neni? Pota na kunupa mbuzi ntendi msambu pamuwera na waganja wangu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kumbiti leru kiza mwana gwaku ayu yakatumiyiti ulunda waku woseri pamuwera na wandiyandiya, na pakawuyiti pakaya panu, gwenga gumshinjira ula ndama likulukulu!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tati gwakuwi kamwankula, ‘Mwana gwangu, gwenga gulikala pahala panu na neni mashaka goseri, vinu vintu vyoseri vyanwera navyi ndo vya gwenga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kumbiti tufiruwa tuvini msambu na kunemelera, toziya mlongu gwaku kahowiti, kumbiti vinu kazyuka, kaweriti kagamila, kumbiti vinu kawoneka.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kalani yakaweriti na pyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi, “Kwanaga na mlundamali ayu yakaweriti na mfundwa yakalolera ulunda wakuwi. Mlunda mali ulii wamgambiriti kuwera yakalolera ulunda wakuwi kaweriti kankuyananga mpiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Su mlundamali ulii kamshema na kumgambira, ‘Avi ndo vitwatira gaa vyampikinira kwaku, gung'ambiri ntambu yagutumiyiti mpiya zyangu, toziya hapeni guweri mlolera ulunda gwangu kayi.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mlolera ulunda kaligambira mweni, ‘Mtuwa gwangu hakanwingi mlihengu lyangu. Hantendi ashi? Neni nahera makakala ga kulima, viraa nana soni kuluwaluwa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vinu nuvimana hantendi ashi! Su pakanwinga lihengu, hanweri na waganja weni hawanshemeli ukaya kwawu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Su kawashemiti wantu woseri weni mtuwa gwakuwi kaweriti kankuwadayi. Kamkosiyiti gwa kwanja, ‘Gwenga mtuwa gwangu kakushonga mpiya ninga?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Mapipa miya ga lipaki lya zeyituni.’ Mlolera ulunda kamgambira, ‘Aga ndo mawalangu gaku, gulivagi pasi, gulembi lilongu mhanu.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shakapanu kamkosiya kayi yumonga, ‘Na gwenga wakushonga mpiya ninga?’ Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Mihaku elufu ya nganu.’ Mlolera ulunda kamgambira, ‘Aga ndo mawalangu gaku, gulembi miya nane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Su mtuwa ulii kamzyumiti nentu mlolera ulunda yakaweriti kana pyera katumiyiti luhala, toziya wantu wa pasipanu wana luhala ng'anji muvitwatira vyawu kuliku wantu wa muweru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kendereyiti kulonga, “Su nukugambirani mwenga, Mtendi uganja kwa kutumiya vintu vya pasipanu, su paviwapelerani hawawashemeri mnumba ya mashaka goseri. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri pakajimira mushintu shididini, hakaweri mjimira muvintu vikulu viraa, na muntu pakajimira ndiri mushintu shididini hapeni kajimiri mushintu shikulu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Handa mwenga pamujimirika ndiri kwa vintu vya pasipanu, ndo gaa hakawapanani vintu viwagira vya nakaka? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na handa mwenga pamuwera waminika ndiri kwa vintu vya wantu wamonga, ndo gaa hakakupani vintu vyenu maweni?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kwahera ntumintumi yakaweza kuwatendera lihengu watuwa wawili, toziya Ntumintumi hakamlemi ayu na kumfira yumonga, ama hakaweri na yumu na kumleka yumonga. Hapeni mwezi kumtendera Mlungu na shipindi shila shilii guyitendera mpiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Gakatakulaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 11:12-13, 5:31-32; Mariku 10:11-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mafalisayu pawapikaniriti goseri aga, wamkaliriti Yesu toziya womberi wafiraga mpiya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga mlilanguziya waheri kulongolu kwa wantu, kumbiti Mlungu kayimana myoyu yenu. Kwa shintu shilii shashiwoneka shana mana nkulu kulongolu kwa wantu, Mlungu kashiwona kuwera shinyankalika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Lilagaliru lya Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu gaweriti mpaka shipindi sha Yohani Mbatiza, kwanjira palii Visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankubwerwa, su kila muntu kankwingira kwa makakala. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kumbiti ndo ikamala ndiri kumpindi na pasi panu kwagamira kuliku lilembu lididini lya Lilagaliru kuliwusiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Muntu yoseri pakamleka mdala gwakuwi na kuyuga mdala gwingi katenda uhumba, na muntu pakamuyuga mdala yawamlekiti viraa katenda uhumba.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlundamali na Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Paweriti na muntu yumu yakaweriti mlundamali, yakavaliti nguwu zya beyi nkulu nentu na kaweriti kankubojola mashaka goseri. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vilaa vilii kuweriti muntu muhushu yawamshema Lazaru, yakaweriti na vironda nshimba yoseri, mweni kalikaliti pamlyagu gwa mlundamali. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pakafira kuliya masigalu ga viboga vyavitulukiriti pasi pameza pa mlundamali. Ata wang'ang'a wiziti na kulambita vironda vyakuwi!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Muhushu pakahowiti kala, wantumintumi wa kupindi wamtoliti na kumtula pakwegera na Aburahamu mumsambu kulaa kumpindi. Na mlundamali kahowiti viraa na wamsira, <verse number="23" style="v"/>na kagenda pahala yapaweriti kwana ntabiku nentu mulirindi lyalihera upeleru, na pakaloliti kamwoniti Aburahamu kwa kutali pamuhera na Lazaru kapakwegera. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Su kanjiti kushema, ‘Tati Aburahamu! Nyagu gumoneri lusungu bamu. Gumtumi Lazaru kajobi shala shakuwi mumashi, kizi kaluzizimisiyi lulimi lwangu, toziya nulikala mundabiku nentu mumotu amu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kumbiti Aburahamu kamgambira, ‘Guliholi mwana gwangu paguweriti gwamkomu gupatiti vintu vyoseri viherepa, kumbiti Lazaru kapatiti vintu vidoda vyoseri. Kumbiti vinu kankunemelera panu, na gwenga gwankutabika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pamuwera na goseri aga, pakati petu panu kwana lirindi likulu nentu, su kwa woseri yawafira kwiza kwa twenga hapeni wawezi, ama kwahera muntu yakaweza kulawa kwenu kwiza uganu ama kwa twenga kwiza kwa mwenga.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mlundamali kalonga, ‘Nyagu nukuluwa tati Aburahamu, gumtumi Lazaru kagendi ukaya kwa tati gwangu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>kwana walongu wangu wamuhanu. Kagendi kawaberiziyi nawiza uganu panu pahala pa ndabiku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Aburahamu kamuwankula, ‘Kwa walongu waku kwana malembu ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu hagawaberiziyi, walongu waku wafiruwa wagapikaniri ntambu yagawagambira.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mlundamali kamwankula, ‘Tati Aburahamu, itosha ndiri! Kumbiti pakazyuka muntu kwawu kulawa kwa wahowiti na kuwagendera, hawampikiniri na kuleka vidoda vyawatenda.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kumbiti Aburahamu kamgambira, ‘Pawagapikanira ndiri malembu ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu, hapeni wajimili ata muntu pakazyuka.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vidoda</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 18:6-7,21-22; Mariku 9:42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Vintu vyavimtenda muntu katendi vidoda mpaka vilawili, kumbiti shondi kwa ulii yakavijega! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayiweri mbaka kwa muntu yakavijega vikomu kumtawa musingu libuwi likulu lya kusagila na kumwasira mubahali, kuliku kumkalaziya yumu gwa wadidini awa watendi vidoda. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muliloleli weri ntambu yamtenda!</para>
  <para style="p">“Handa mlongu gwaku pakatenda vidoda, gumkalipiri na pakaleka gumlekizii. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Handa pakakukoseya mala saba kwa lishaka limu, na kila shipindi pakakuwuyira na kutakula, ‘Vyantenditi gunekiziyi,’ su gufiruwa gumlekizii.”</para>
  <para style="s">Moyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wantumintumi wamgambiriti Mtuwa, “Gutongeleri njimiru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mtuwa kawankula, “Handa njimiru yenu payiwera nkulu gambira mbeyu ya ndidini nentu, hamuwezi kugugambira mtera gwa mkuyu, ‘Gutupuki gukaliyoshikeri mubahali!’ Ndo meguwajimili.</para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya ntumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Yumu pakati penu pakawera na ntumintumi yakalima lirambu ama kankulolera wakondolu. Pakawuya kulawa kulirambu, hakamgambiri ntumintumi ulii kamkamu, gwizi gulii shiboga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ndala! Hakamgambiri, ‘Gunyawili huti shiboga, shakapanu guvali na guweri kala kuntendera mpaka mmalili kuliya na kulanda, shakapanu gwenga hagulii.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hashi, hagulongi mayagashii kwa ntumintumi toziya katenda vyakamgambiriti? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ntambu iraa ayi kwa mwenga, pamtenda kala vyoseri vyawawagambiriti mtendi, mlongi, ‘Twenga twawantumintumi hera weni twahera mota, tutenda hera lihengu lyetu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wangumbula lilongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti mumwanja kugenda Yerusalemu, kapitiliti mumipaka mwa Samariya na Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pakaweriti kankwingira pashijiji, kaliwoniti na wantu lilongu limu yawaweriti na ungumbula. Wagolokiti kwa kutali <verse number="13" style="v"/>na wabotanga pawalonga, “Yesu! Mtuwa! Gutuwoneri lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kawawoniti na kawagambira, “Mgendi mwakaliwonisiyi kwa mkulu gwa ludewa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pawaweriti munjira wankugenda su wapungikiti. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumu pakati pawu pakawoniti handa kapona, kawuyiti pakamkwisa Mlungu kwa liziwu likulu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kasuntama makukama pa magulu ga Yesu nakulonga mayagashii kwa Yesu. Muntu ulii kaweriti Msamariya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Kuweriti na wantu lilongu yawapungitwi, wakoshi walii wamonga tisa? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwera ashi muhenga ayu gweka yakuwi ndo kiza kumkwisa Mlungu?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na Yesu kamgambira, “Gugoloki na gugendi, njimiru yaku ikuponiziya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Ufalumi wa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:23-28,37-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mafalisayu wamu wamkosiyiti Yesu, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankwiza ndi?” Yomberi kawankula, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankwiza ndiri ntambu ya kuwoneka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwahera muntu hakawezi kutakula, ‘Guloli’ wapalaa! Ama ‘Wa palii!’ Toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu wamngati mwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shakapanu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Shipindi hakizi pamfira kulilola lishaka limu mumashaka ga Mwana gwa Muntu, kumbiti hapeni muliwoni. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wantu woseri hawakugambirani, ‘Mloli, ka palii!’ Ama, ‘Mloli ka panu!’ Kumbiti mwenga namlawa pota namuwafata, <verse number="24" style="v"/>toziya Mwana gwa Adamu mumashaka gakuwi, hakaweri gambira lumeta lwa lupanda ntambu yalulangala kulyera kwanjira uwega umu mpaka uwega umonga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kumbiti kwanja kafiruwa katabiki muvitwatira vivuwa na kulemwa na wantu wa shiyiwuku ashi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ntambu yayiweriti mumashaka ga Nuhu, ndo hayiweri mumashaka ga Mwana gwa Muntu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wantu wendereyiti kuliya na kulanda, na wapalu hawayugi na wadala kuyugwa mpaka shipindi shilii Nuhu pakayingiliti musafina. Mafuliku galawiti na kuwalaga woseri. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hayiweri gambira shipindi sha Lutu. Wantu wendereyiti kuliya na kulanda, kuhemera na kuuza, kuyala na kunyawa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lishaka lilii Lutu pakawukiti Sodoma, motu na mabuhi ga motu gatowiti gambira mvula kulawa kumpindi na kuwalaga woseri. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ntambu ayi hayiweri mulijuwa lilii Mwana gwa Muntu pakawoneka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Lijuwa lilii muntu yakawera pampindi pashitwiku pa numba yakuwi nakasuluka pasi kutola ulunda wakuwi, Ntambu iraa ayi muntu yoseri pakawera kuisi na kawuya ukaya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mmuholi mdala gwa Lutu! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yoseri yakafira kugaponiziya makaliru gakuwi, hakagamiziyi na yoseri yakagamiziya makaliru gakuwi hakagalopoziyi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nukugambirani, pashiru palii wantu wawili hawaweri wankugonja mushitanda shimuwera, yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wadala wawili hawaweri wankusaga usaka pamuwera, yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wantu wawili hawaweri wankutenda lihengu mulirambu, yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki <verse number="37" style="v"/>wantumini wamkosiyiti Yesu, “Koshi Mtuwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawankula, “Papawera na lintumbi, kunguru ndo hawaliwoni pamuwera.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mdala mkenja na hakimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiliti wantumintumi wakuwi mfanu, kawafunda wafiruwa kuluwa Mlungu mashaka goseri pota na koya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Mlushi lumu kuweriti na mtoza yakamtira ndiri Mlungu, ama kumjali muntu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na kuweriti na mkenja mulushi lulii yakamgenderiti hakimu pakaluwa haki yakuwi pakatakula, ‘Guntangi mpati shanfuruwa kupata kulawa kwa mngondu gwangu.’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa shipindi shivuwa hakimu kafiriti ndiri kumtanga, kumbiti upeleru wakuwi kaligambira mweni, ‘Tembera neni namtira ndiri Mlungu pota kulishera wantu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>toziya mkenja ayu kangaziyaga nentu, hanumwamuliri shauri lyakuwi. Pantenda ndiri hakendereyi kwiza panu na upeleru hakang'aziyi nentu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mtuwa kendereyiti kutakula, “Mpikaniri ntambu yakatakuliti mtoza ayu mdoda. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vinu, hashi Mlungu hapeni kawamuliri wantu wakuwi yawamlilira pashiru na paliwala? Hashi, hakakawi kuwatanga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nukugambirani, hakawamuliri kanongola. Kumbiti Mwana gwa Muntu pakiza hakuweri na njimiru pasipanu?”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mafalisayu na watola kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiriti viraa mfanu gwagufata gwa walii yawalilola kuwera waherepa na kuwazarawu wantu wamonga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Kuweriti na wantu wawili wakweniti kugenda Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu kuluwa. Yumu kaweriti Mfalisayu na yumonga mtola kodi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mfalisayu kagolokiti gweka yakuwi na kuluwa shimoyumoyu pakalonga, “ ‘Mlungu mayagashii, neni nanalwaliya ndiri, nampayu ndiri ama mndiyandiya gambira wantu wamonga. Nonga mayagashii kwaku toziya neni nulifana ndiri gambira mtola kodi ayu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nfunga mala mbili mulijuma, ndaviya fungu lilongu lya vintu vyampatiti.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kumbiti mtola kodi kagolokiti kwa kutali, kanyasula ndiri sheni shakuwi kumpindi, su kahinginika mumoyu mwakuwi pakalonga, “Mlungu, gumoneri lusungu neni yantenda vidoda!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nukugambirani, mtola kodi kawuyiti ukaya pawamlekeziyiti vidoda vyakatenditi, kumbiti Mfarisayu ulii wamlekeziyiti ndiri vidoda vyakatenda. Toziya woseri yawafira kulikweniziya hawawasulusiyi, na woseri yawalisulusiya weni hawawakweniziyi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawatekelera wana wadidini</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 19:13-15; Mariku 10:13-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wantu wamu wamjegiriti Yesu wana wadidini su kawatulili mawoku gakuwi. Wafundwa pawawoniti, wawalewelera ntambu yawatenda, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kumbiti Yesu kawashema wana wizi kwakuwi pakalonga, “Muwaleki wana wadidini wizi kwaneni, namuwalewelera toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu ndo wa wantu gambira awa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nukugambirani nakaka! Muntu yoseri yakanka ndiri Ufalumi wa Mlungu gambira mwana mdidini hapeni kingiri amu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mlundamali</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 19:16-30; Mariku 10:17-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mkulu gwa Wayawudi kamkosiyiti Yesu, “mfunda muheri, ntendi shishi nwezi kupata ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamkosiya, “Iwera ashi gunshema muheri? Kwahera muntu yakawera muheri kumbiti Mlungu gweka yakuwi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gugamana malagaliru, ‘Naguwera muhumba, nagulaga, nagwiwa, nagumtakulila mpayu muntu yoseri, guwapanani ligoya tati na mawu gwaku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yomberi kawankula, “Kwanjira panweriti mdidini, nugajimira malagaliru goseri aga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu pakapikaniriti aga kamgambira, “Guleka shintu shimu shagufiruwa kutenda. Guwuzi kila shintu shaguwera nashu na guwagawiri wahushu mpiya azi, na gwenga haguweri mlundamali kumpindi, su gwizi na gunfati.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kumbiti muntu ulii pakapikaniriti aga, kahinginikiti nentu toziya kaweriti mlunda nentu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kawoniti ntambu yakahinginikiti na katakula, “Ntambu ayi hayiweri vikamala kwa wantu walunda kwingira mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hayiweri ikamala kwa walunda mali kwingira mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu kuliku shigongolu shawamshema Ngamiya kupena mushitoboli sha sindanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wantu walii pawapikaniriti aga wakosiya, “Su gaa hakalopoziwi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Gawezekana ndiri kwa wantu, kumbiti kwa Mlungu gawezekana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Peteru kamgambira, “Guloli! Twenga tuleka kaya zetu na kukufata gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Yina! Nukugambirani nakaka muntu yoseri yakalekiti numba, ama mdala, ama walongu, ama mawu na watati wakuwi, ama wana toziya ya Ufalumi wa Mlungu <verse number="30" style="v"/>hakawanki gavuwa nentu mushipindi ashi na mushipindi shashiza hakawanki ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawagambira mala ya tatu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 20:17-19; Mariku 10:32-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawatoliti wantumintumi walii lilongu na wawili na kuwagambira, “Mpikaniri! Twankugenda Yerusalemu kulii kila shintu wambuyi wa Mlungu walembiti, kuusu Mwana gwa Muntu hagalawiri. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hawamupanani kwa wantu yawaweriti ndiri Wayawudi, na womberi hawamtenderi lidufiya na hawamwigilangi na hawamtemeri mata. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hawamsyatangi ndomontu na hawamlagi, kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti hakazyuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kumbiti wantumintumi wavimaniti ndiri vintu vyoseri avi, mana ya visoweru viweriti vififwa kwawomberi, na wavimaniti ndiri shakatakuliti Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya Muntu kana lwisi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 20:29-34; Mariku 10:46-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti kapakwegera na Yeriku, kuweriti na muntu yakana lwisi yakalivagiti panjira pakaluwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pakapikaniriti lipinga lya wantu lyankupita kakosiya, “Kwana shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Womberi wamgambira, “Yesu gwa Nazareti kankupita.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nayomberi kalila kwa liziwu likulu, “Yesu! Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gumoneri lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wantu wawalongoleriti wamkalipira pawamgambira kanyamalili. Kumbiti yomberi kendereyiti kubotanga, “Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gumoneri lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kagolokiti, na kawagambira wamjegeri muntu kana lwisi ulii. Muntu kana lwisi pakasokiti pakwegela, Yesu kamkosiya, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Gufira nukutenderi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayomberi kawankula, “Mtuwa nduwa mpati kuwona kayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Guwoni! Kwakunjimira kwaku, ndo gupona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pala palii, kaweza kuwona, na kamgendera Yesu, kalonga mayagashii kwa Mlungu. Lipinga lya wantu pawawoniti hangu, wamkwisiti Mlungu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kingiriti Yeriku, kaweriti kankupita munjira za lushi alu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuweriti na mkulu gwa watola kodi yawamshema Zakayu, mweni kaweriti mlundamali. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kafiriti kumwona Yesu kaweriti gwa ntambu gaa, kumbiti toziya ya lipinga lya wantu na toziya kaweriti mfupi, na kasinditi kumwona Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Su kalongolera mbiru, kakwena pampindi pa mkuyu su kawezi kumwona Yesu kaweriti kankupita njira ayi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti kankwiza pahala palii, kaloliti kumtera na kumgambira Zakayu, “Kanongola gusuluki, toziya nfiruwa kulikala mnumba mwaku leru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zakayu kasuluka kanongola, kumshemera kwa kunemelera. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wantu woseri pawawoniti hangu, wanjiti kuhinginika pawalonga, “Muntu ayu kagenda kuwera muhenga yakanaligoya ukaya kwa yakana vidoda!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Zakayu kagoloka, kumgambira Mtuwa, “Gupikaniri, Mtuwa! Hanuwapanani wahushu nusu ya ulunda wangu, na handa panumupokiti muntu yoseri kwa kumupayira hanumuwuzilili mala msheshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Ulopoziwu usoka mnumba amu leru, toziya muntu ayu vira ndo kamushiyiwuku sha Aburahamu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwana gwa Muntu kiziti kusakula na kuwalopoziya yawagamiliti.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa wantumini lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 25:14-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wantu pawaweriti wankupikanira aga, Yesu kendereyiti kuwagambira mfanu. Pakaweriti pakwegera kusoka Yerusalemu na wantu walii waliholiti kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu sambira usoka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Su kawagambira, “Kuweriti na muntu yumu yakaweriti mkulu yakagenda muisi ya kutali kaweri mfalumi, shakapanu kawuyi ukaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pamberi pa kuwuka, kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi lilongu na kuwapanani mpiya kila yumu na kuwagambira, ‘Guloli ntambu yamuweza kutenda pambuka.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vinu wantu wakuwi wamgalambukiti, pakawukiti kala, wawatumiti wajumbi walongi, ‘Tumfira ndiri muntu ayu kaweri mfalumi gwetu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Muntu ulii pawamtyeka kala kuwera mfalumi kawuyiti ukaya. Palii kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi kafira kavimani ntambu ya kila muntu kapata mpiya zininga kuliku ntambu yakawayupiti. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa kwanja kiza na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, mpata mpiya lilongu nentu ya mpiya yimu yagunupiti.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nayomberi kamgambira, ‘Gutenda weri, gwenga gwa ntumintumi guherepa! Toziya guwera gwa mwaminika kwa shintu shididini, hanukutuli guweri mkulu kwa lushi zya milongu.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ntumintumi gwa pili kiza na katakula, ‘Mtuwa, mpata mpiya zyamuhanu nentu ya mpiya yimu yagunupiti.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwa yumu ayu kamgambira, ‘Haguweri mkulu gwa lushi zya muhanu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Ntumintumi gwingi kiza na kutakula, ‘Mtuwa, mpiya yaku ayi, ntawiti mushitambala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nukutuliriti gwenga toziya gwenga gwa muntu gukalipa. Gwenga gutolaga shilii shaku ndiri na kubena shilii shaguyala ndiri.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nayomberi kamgambira, ‘Gwenga gwa ntumintumi gufaa ndiri! Nukutoza kulawirana na visoweru vyaku! Guvimana neni muntu nkalipa, ntola shilii shashiwera ndiri shaneni na mbenanga vilii vyanyala ndiri.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Su iwera hashi gutuliti ndiri mpiya zyangu muluhanja? Pambuyiti hampati mpiya yangu pamuhera na mota yakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Shakapanu kawagambira woseri yawaweriti wagoloka palii, ‘Mmupoki mpiya ayi na mumupi ntumintumi ulii yakongeriti mpiya lilongu.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kumbiti womberi wamgambira, ‘Mtuwa, ayu kana mpiya kala mala lilongu!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nayomberi kawankula, ‘Nukugambirani woseri yawawera na shintu, hawongelerwi, kumbiti woseri yawahera na shintu, ata shilii shididini shawawera nashi hawawapoki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vinu woseri walii yawaweriti wangondu wangu yawanfira ndiri neni nweri mfalumi gwawu, muwajegi panu na kuwalaga palongolu pa masu gangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Yerusalemu kwa shereku</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 21:1-11; Mariku 11:1-11; Yohani 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu pakatakuliti kala aga, su kawalonguleriti kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakaweriti pakwegera kusoka Betifagi na Betaniya, mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni, kawatumiti wafundwa wawili <verse number="30" style="v"/>kawagambira, “Mgendi mushijiji sha palongolu penu, pamwingira hamwoni punda wamtawa mweni hakenitumiki na muntu. Mumyopoli na mumjegi panu. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Mwana gwa punda</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri pakawakosiya, iwera hashi mwankumyopola, mumgambiri Mtuwa kamfira.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wagenditi munjira yawu, wawona kila shintu Yesu ntambu yakawagambiriti. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pawaweriti wankumyopola punda ulii, weni yawawera na punda wawakosiya, “Iwera hashi mwankumyopola punda ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nawomberi wamwankula, “Mtuwa kamfira,” <verse number="35" style="v"/>su wamjega punda ulii kwa Yesu. Shakapanu wamyalikira nguwu zyawu pampindi pa punda na wamtanga Yesu kumkweniziya pampindi pakuwi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kendereya na mwanja, na wantu wayalika nguwu zyawu munjira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pakasokiti pakwegera na Yerusalemu, panjira panda ya lugongu lwa Mizeyituni, lipinga likulu lya wafundwa wanjiti kutenda lusheka na nemeleru walonga mayagashii Mlungu na kumkwisa yomberi kwa liziwu likulu pawatakula mauzauza makulu wagawoniti, <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Mlungu gumtekeleri mfalumi yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa! Ponga iweri kumpindi nentu kwa Mlungu na ukwisa uweri kwa Mlungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shakapanu Wamafalisayu wamu mulipinga lilii lya wantu wamgambira Yesu, “mfunda, guwanyamaziyi wafundwa waku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Nukugambirani, handa pawanyamalila, mabuhi aga haganji kubotanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankululilira lushi lwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pawasokiti pakwegera na lushi lwa Yerusalemu, na pakaluwona kanjiti kululilira, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kalonga, “Meguvimani! Leru ayi vitwtatira vijega ponga. Kumbiti vinu galififa pamasu paku. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shipindi shankwiza ndo sheni wangondu waku hawakuzyengeti kwa maboma, hawakupingili na kukubabanika wega zoseri. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hawakwagamiziyi gwenga na wantu yawalikala mngati, hapeni wakulekeli ata libuwi limu panani pa limonga, toziya gushimana ndiri shipindi sha Mlungu pakakwiziriti kukulopoziya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 21:12-17; Mariku 11:15-19; Yohani 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kingiriti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kanja kuwawinga walii yawawuza vintu palii, <verse number="46" style="v"/>kawagambira, “Walembiti mumalembu, Mlungu pakalonga, ‘Numba nkulu ya neni hayiweri numba ya kusalira.’ Kumbiti mwenga muyitenda mpanga ya wapoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kila lishaka Yesu kaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, na wakulu wa wantu wafiriti kumlaga, <verse number="48" style="v"/>kumbiti wasinditi ntambu yakutenda aga, toziya wantu woseri waweriti wankumpikinira weri kila shisoweru shakatakuliti, na wafiriti ndiri kukosa shisoweru ata shimu.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu liusu Uwezu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 21:23-27; Mariku 11:27-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankuwafunda wantu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kuvibwera visoweru viwagira, watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, pamuhera na wazewi, wiziti <verse number="2" style="v"/>na wamgambira, “Gutugambiri, gutenda vintu vyoseri avi kwa uwezu wa gaa? Ndo gaa yakakupiti uwezu wa kutenda aga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Vinu naneni hanuwakosiyi. Mung'ambiri, <verse number="4" style="v"/>uwezu wa kubatiza wa Yohani Mbatiza ulawiti kumpindi ama ulawiti kwa wantu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Womberi wanjiti kuligambirana weni, “Hatulongi hashi? Patulonga, ‘Ulawiti kumpindi,’ yomberi hakatakuli, ‘Iwera hashi munjimira ndiri?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kumbiti patulonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wantu,’ lipinga lyoseri lya wantu panu hawatugumi mabuhi, toziya woseri wavimaniti kuwera Yohani kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Su wamwankula, “Tuvimana ndiri uwezu wakuwi ulawiti koshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Vira neni hapeni nuwagambirani ntenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa lirambu lya Mizyabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 21:33-46; Mariku 12:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiriti wantu mfanu agu, “Kweniti na muntu yakayaliti mizyabibu mulirambu, kawazimila wakulima na mweni kagenditi mwanja, kalikaliti kulii shipindi shivuwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shipindi sha kubenanga zyabibu shisokiti, kamtumiti mmanda kagendi kwa wakulima, kakatoli seemu ya mabenangu ga lirambu lya mizyabibu. Kumbiti wakulima wamkomanga ntumintumi ulii na wamuwuziya ukaya mawoku hera. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Su kamtumiti ntumintumi gwingi, kumbiti wakulima walii wamkoma kayi na kumtendera vidoda, na wamwuziya ukaya mawoku hera. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamtumiti ntumintumi gwa tatu, wakulima wamkoma mpaka kawera na vironda, shakapanu wamuwingawinga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mweni kana lirambu kalikosiya, ‘Hantendi hashi? Hanumtumi mwana gwangu yanumfira, neni wera na unakaka hawamupanani ligoya!’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kumbiti wakulima walii pawamwoniti, wanja kuligambira, ‘Ayu ndo mhala gwakuwi. Tumlagi, uhala wakuwi hawuweri wa twenga!’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Su wamlaviya kunja kulirambu, wamlaga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawakosiya, “Yakana lirambu ulii hakawatendi hashi wakulima walii? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hakizi kuwalaga wakulima woseri, na hakawapanani wakulima wamonga lirambu lilii lya mizyabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu pawapikaniriti, watakula, “Iwezekana ndiri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawaloliti na kukosiya, “Su Malembu aga Mananagala gana mana gaa?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libuwi lyawalilemiti wanyawa wa numba,</para>
  <para style="q">vinu ligalambuka na liwera libuwi lyaliwera na mana nentu kuliku goseri.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muntu yoseri pakaguwa pampindi pa libuwi hakamegeki vipandi vipandi, na libuwi palimtulukira muntu yoseri, halimtendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu lya kulipa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 22:15-22; Mariku 12:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wafunda wa Malagaliru na watambika wakulu wafiriti kumbata, toziya wavimaniti mfanu agu guweriti kankuwatakula womberi, kumbiti palii wawatiriti wantu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Su waweriti wankusakula shipindi shifaa. Wawapanani wantu wamu mpiya walitendi waheri, su wawatuma wagendi kumjera Yesu kwa kumkosiya, su wawezi kumbata na kumjega kwa wakulu wa serikali ya Rumi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Walolalo walii wamgambira Yesu, “mfunda, tuvimana ntambu yagutakula na kufunda vitwatira vya nakaka. Tuvimana gwenga gwahera ubagula kwa muntu yoseri ulii, kumbiti gwenga gufunda unakaka wa vintu vyakafira Mlungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Gutugambiri, handa vya halali ama vyahalali ndiri kulipa kodi kwa Kaisari!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti shawafira na kawagambira, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mnanguziyi mpiya. Sheni sha mumpiya sha gaa na malembu yagalembwa mumpiya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwankula, “vya Kaisari.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawagambira, “Su vya Kaisari mpanani Kaisari na vya Mlungu mpanani Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Waweza ndiri kumbata kwa shisoweru shoseri palii palongolu pa wantu, su wanyamaliti, pawalikangasha ntambu yakawankuliti.</para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu lya kuzyuka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 22:23-33; Mariku 12:18-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shakapanu Masadukayu wamu, yawalongaga wantu yawahowa hapeni wazyuki, wamwiziriti Yesu na kulonga, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“mfunda, Musa katulembiriti Lilagaliru ali, ‘Muntu pakahowa na kumleka mdala yakahera mwana, mpaka mlongu gwakuwi kamtoli mkenja ulii su kamleleri wana mlongu gwakuwi yakahowiti.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vinu kuweriti na walongu saba. Mkulu yakalongoleriti kumyuga kahowa pakaleka ndiri mwana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mlongu gwa pili kamuyuga mdala mkenja ulii, <verse number="31" style="v"/>na mlongu gwa tatu ntambu ira, vitwatira viweriti vira virii kwa woseri saba, wahowiti pawaleka ndiri wana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Upeleru wakuwi na mdala mkenja ulii kahowiti vira. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vinu mulishaka lya wahowiti kuzyuka, mdala ulii hakaweri gwa gaa? Toziya woseri saba wamuyugiti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Mushipindi ashi wapalu wayuga wadala, <verse number="35" style="v"/>kumbiti wapalu na wadala weni Mlungu hakawatangi kuwera mushipindi sha kuzyuka, hapeni wapalu wayugi wala wadala kuyugwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hawaweri gambira wantumintumi wa kumpindi na hapeni wahowi. Womberi ndo wana wa Mlungu, toziya wazyuka kulawa kwa wahowiti. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kumbiti Musa kalanguziyiti weri kuwera yawahowiti hawazyuki. Mumalembu Mananagala galembitwi shakatakuliti Mtuwa ndo Mlungu gwa Aburahamu, na Mlungu gwa Isaka, na Mlungu gwa Yakobu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mlungu ndo gwa yawawera wakomu, na Mlungu ndiri gwa wahowiti, kwakuwi woseri walikala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru watakula, “mfunda guwankula weri!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Watakuliti hangu toziya wasinditi kumkosiya kayi makosiwu gamonga.</para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu liusu Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 22:41-46; Mariku 12:35-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kawakosiya, “Watakula hashi kulonga Kristu kawera mwana gwa Dawudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mweni Dawudi kalemba kala mushintola sha Zaburi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mtuwa kamgambiriti Mtuwa gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Gwikali kumliwu kwaneni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpaka nuwatuli wangondu waku kuwera shiti sha kutulila magulu gaku.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Dawudi kamshemiti yomberi, ‘Mtuwa.’ Hayiweri hashi Mesiya kaweri mwana gwa Dawudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwakalipira wantu kuusu Wafunda wa Malagaliru</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 23:1-36; Mariku 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi kulongolu kwa wantu woseri, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Muliloleri weri kuusu wafunda wa Malagaliru, weni wafira kugendagenda pawavalira lihabiti na wafira kulamsiwa kwa ligoya pahala pa masoku, weni wasyagula kulivaga pahala pa ligoya munumba zya Mlungu, na pahala paherepa mumsambu, <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wawagambira wakenja mpayu na kuwapoka numba zyawu na pawaluwa Mlungu luwi ntali! Azabu yawu hayiweri nkulu nentu!”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya Mkenja</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 12:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalola wega zoseri, kawawona wantu walunda pawatula mafupu gawu mulisanduku lya luhanja Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>vira virii kamwoniti mkenja muhushu nentu pakatula senti ndidika mbili zya mpiya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawagambira, “Nukugambirani kuwera nakaka mkenja muhushu ayu kalaviya zivuwa kuliku woseri wamonga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamonga walaviyiti mafupu gawu galii gagaziditi muulunda wawu, kumbiti muhushu ayu kwa uhushu wakuwi kalaviya vyoseri vyakalitumbiriti.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkakutakula kuhalibisiwa kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:1-2; Mariku 13:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wantumini wamu waweriti wankutakula kuusu Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, ntambu yawaherepeziya kwa mabuhi gaherepa na mafupu wagalaviyiti kwa Mlungu. Yesu kawagambira, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Goseri aga gamgalola, shipindi shankwiza peni hapeni lisigali libuwi limu pahala pakuwi, kila shintu hashiharibiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tabika na beziwu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:3-14; Mariku 13:3-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Womberi wamkosiyiti, “mfunda, visoweru avi havilawili ndii? Hashilawiri shishi kutulanguziya kuwera shipindi ashi shankwiza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Mliloli weri, nawawazyangani. Wantu wavuwa hawizi pawatakula shisoweru shangu, hawizi na kulonga, ‘Neni ndo mweni!’ Na ‘Shipindi hashizi!’ Kumbiti namuwafata. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Namtira pampikanira ngondu na ndewu, vintu vyoseri avi mpaka vilawiri kwanja, kumbiti upeleru wa vitwatira avi wankali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kendereya kutakula, “Isi yimu hailikomangi na isi yimonga, na ufalumi umu haulikomi na ufalumi umonga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hakuweri na malendemeru makulu ga isi na hakuweri na njala na ulweri wa tawuni pahala poseri, hakuweri na vitwatira vya kutiliziya na lilangaliru likulu kulawa kuliyera. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pamberi pagalawira goseri aga, hawawabati na kuwatabisiya na hawawajegeni munumba za Mlungu na kuwatula muvibetubetu, hawawajegeni kulongolu kwa wafalumi na wakulu toziya munamini neni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ayi hayiweri lupenyu lwenu kuvibwera visoweru viwagira. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kumbiti muvimani mumyoyu mwenu, namlihola ntambu ya kujiteteya, <verse number="15" style="v"/>toziya Namweni neni hanuwapanani mwenga lulimi na luhala vyeni wangondu wenu woseri hapeni wawezi kusindana naga na kugalema gamtakula. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hagugalambukwi na mawu na tati gwaku, na walongu waku, na waganja waku, na wamonga pakati penu hawawalagi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wantu woseri hawawakalalirani mwenga toziya ya litawu lyaneni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kumbiti hapeni luagamili ata luvili lumu mumituwi mwenu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Muweri pamgangamala mumoyu, hamliponiziyi weni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkakutunga kuhalibisiwa isi ya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:15-21; Mariku 13:14-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Pamwona Yerusalemu guzyengetwa na wangondu, su hamvimani kuwera shipindi shisoka peni isi ayi hayiharabisiwi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Woseri yawalikala Muyudeya watugili mulugongu, woseri yawawera mulushi wawuki, na woseri yawawera mumalambu nawawuya mulushi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Toziya mashaka aga hagaweri ‘Mashaka ga kutoza,’ kulanguziya koseri kwakulembitwi mumalembu Mananagala gatimii. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shondi shondi wamawu yawawera na yinda na walii yawanoniziya mumashaka galii! Toziya hakuweri na malweri gavuwa muisi, na utoza wa Mlungu hawuwayizili wantu awa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wamonga hawawalagi kwa upanga, na wamonga hawawatuli muvibetubetu muisi zoseri, na hawawatoli lopola mumaisi goseri na Yerusalemu hayitimbwi na wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu mpaka shipindi shawu pashimalilika.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana gwa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:29-31; Mariku 13:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hakuweri na lilangaliru mumshenji, na mulyezi, na muntondu. Pasipanu wantu woseri yawaweriti muisi zoseri hawaweri na uhushu, lyoga lya kulishera kwa mtukuliru gwa makupala ga bahari na mihenyuhenyu yakuwi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wantu pawafuwa myoyu kwa lyoga, pawalola vitwatira vyeni havilawili pasipanu, makakala ga kumpindi hagatikinyiki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shipindi shilii Mwana gwa Muntu hakalawili, pakiza mumawingu pakawera na makakala pamuwera na ukwisa mkulu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vintu avi pavyanja kulawira, mkalamuki na mnyasuli mituwi yenu kumpindi toziya ulopoziwu wenu wapakwegera.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mtera gwa mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 24:32-35; Mariku 13:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambiriti mfanu agu, “Mguloli mtera gwa mkuyu na mitera yamonga yoseri. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pamuwoniti mihamba yankwanja kumera, muvimana kuwera shipindi sha kutowa vula shapakwegera. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ntambu ira ayi, pamwona vitwatira avi vyankulawira, muvimani handa Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mliholi kuwera vintu vyoseri havilawili huti pamberi pa wantu woseri yawalikala vinu kuhowa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kumpindi na pasi panu hazipiti, kumbiti visoweru vyangu hapeni vipiti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mliloleri weri! Namuwera vyambojola bojola, na lukologelu na lyaliya, ama pamlilola weri ndiri lishaka lilii halikwizireni vumu hera, <verse number="35" style="v"/>gambira mgomiziwu. Toziya haguwayizili kwa wantu woseri yawalikala pahala poseri pasi panu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mwenga mulikali masu na mumluwi Mlungu mashaka goseri su mpati makakala ga kugenda weri muvitwatira vyoseri vyeni ndo havilawili na kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mwana gwa Muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mashaka goseri paliwala, Yesu kaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, na pamihi kaweriti kankugenda kulikala mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kila pamandawila wantu woseri wagenditi Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu kumpikinira.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:1-5; Mariku 14:1-2; Yohani 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Msambu gwa mabumunda gachechema ndiri, yagushemwa Pasaka guweri sambira gusoka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru waweriti wankusakula njira ya kumlaga Yesu kwa bada, toziya wawatiriti wantu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kankujimila kumgalambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:14-16; Mariku 14:10-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shetani kamwingiriti Yuda, yawamshema Isikariyoti, yumu gwa wantumini walii lilongu na wawili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Su Yuda kagenditi na kuyowera na Watambika wakulu na walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ntambu ya kumgalambuka Yesu kwawomberi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Womberi weniti manemu na wayoweriti na yomberi wamlipi mpiya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda kajimiliti, na kaweriti kankusakula lupenyu luherepa lwa kumlaviya Yesu kwawomberi pota na lipinga lya wantu kuvimana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulitanda kuliya Shiboga sha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:17-25; Mariku 14:12-21; Yohani 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lishaka lisokiti lya msambu gwa mabumunda gachechema ndiri, wakondolu wa shiboga sha Pasaka pawawadumuliti. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawatumiti Peteru na Yohani, kawagambira, “Mgendi mwakatunyawili shiboga sha Pasaka tupati kuliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Womberi wamkosiyiti, “Gufira twakanyawi koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawankula, “Pamgenda mulushi, hamliwoni na mpalu yakalitwika shiwiga sha mashi. Mmufati mpaka mnumba pakayingira, <verse number="11" style="v"/>mumgambiri mweni kana numba, ‘mfunda kankukosiya, shakoshi shumbakati mweni handiyi Pasaka pamuhera na wafundwa wangu?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yomberi hakawalanguziyi numbakati nkulu mugorofa wayiherepeziya, munyawi amu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wagenditi na woniti kila shintu sawa ntambu Yesu yakawagambiriti, wanyawa shiboga sha Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Shiboga sha Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:26-30; Mariku 14:22-26; 1 Wakorintu 11:23-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shipindi pashisokiti, Yesu kalikaliti kuliya shiboga pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawagambira, “Nfira nentu kuliya Pasaka ayi pamuhera na mwenga pamberi pa kundabisiya! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nukugambirani ayi ndo Pasaka ya upeleru kuliya na mwenga mpaka palii payiwera kala mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu katola shikombi, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalonga, “Muwanki shikombi ashi na mlandiri woseri. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nukugambirani, kwanjira vinu hanandi kayi ndiri divayi ayi mpaka Ufalumi wa Mlungu pawiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shakapanu katoliti libumunda, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalimega na kawapanana womberi pakalonga, “Ayi ndo nshimba ya neni yailaviwa kwajili ya mwenga. Mtendi hangu kwa kunhola neni.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Viraa avi, kawapanana shikombi sha divayi pawaliyiti kala shiboga, pakalonga, “Lutekeru alu ndo lipatanu lya syayi lyalilaviyitwi kwa mwazi gwangu wagwitika toziya ya mwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mloli! Ulii yakang'alambuka ka palaa kankuliya pamuhera naneni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwana gwa Muntu hakahowi ntambu yakafiriti Mlungu, kumbiti shodi kwa muntu yakamgalambuka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Palaa wanjiti kulikosiya weni, su gaa pakati petu hakatendi shitwatila ashi.</para>
  <para style="s">Likakatala lya Ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kulawiriti likakatala pakati pa wantumintumi walii gaa ndo hakawezi kuwera mkulu pakati pawu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “Wafalumi wa maisi yawawera ndiri Wayawudi yawakolamlima wantu wawu kwa makakala, nawomberi pawawashema ‘Waganja wa wantu.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kumbiti nayiwera hangu pakati penu, kumbiti ulii yakaweriti mkulu pakati penu ndo kalazima kaweri mdidiki gwa woseri, na yakawera mlongoziya ndo kaweri ndundami. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gaa yakaweriti mkulu, ulii yakalikala pasi kuliya shiboga, ama ulii yakatumika? Imanikana ulii yakalikala pameza kuliya shiboga! Kumbiti neni ndo nandundami pakati penu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mwenga mlikala pamuwera na neni shipindi shoseri sha kujerwa kwangu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>gambira Tati gwangu ntambu yakanupiti ukolamlima, su naneni hanuwapanani ntambu ira ayi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hamlii na kulanda pameza pangu mu Utuwa wangu na hamulikali muvibanta vya ufalumi kugatoza makabila lilongu na mawili ga Israeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga handa Peteru hakamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:31-35; Mariku 14:27-31; Yohani 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Simoni, Simoni! Gupikaniri! Shetani kapatiti ruusa ya kuwajera mwenga mawoseri, kuvilaviya viherepa kulawa muvidoda, gambira mkulima pakapeta nganu kulawa mumakapi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kumbiti neni nankuluwira kwa Mlungu, Simoni njimiru yaku nayidodomera. Nagwenga pagumbuyira, guwatangi wayagu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa, neni ng'enda kala pamuhera na gwenga mushibetubetu, na ata kuhowa pamuhera na gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwankula, “Nukugambira gwenga Peteru, pamberi njogolu hakeniwiki leru hagunemi mala ndatu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulitanda mushipindi sha ndabiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kawakosiyiti wantumintumi wakuwi, “Shipindi shanuwatumiti pota na mpiya, na muhaku ama vilwatu, mpungukiwitwi shintu shoseri?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwankula, “Ndala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambira, “kumbiti vinu, ulii yakawera na muhaku gwa mpiya kagutoli, yakahera na upanga, kawuzi nguwu yakuwi na kahemeri upanga umu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Toziya nukugambirani, Malembu Mananagala galembwa, ‘Wamtuliti shipinga shimuwera pamuhera na wavidoda,’ ndo mpaka gatimii kwa neni, toziya shawalemba kuusu neni shankwiza kuwera nakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Wantumintumi walonga, “Guloli Mtuwa! Panu kwana mapanga mawili!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kalonga, “Ayi itosha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankusali mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:36-46; Mariku 14:32-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa mulushi na kugenda, ntambu yaiweriti ntambu yakuwi, kagenda mpaka kulugongu lwa mizeyituni, wafundwa wakuwi wamfata. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pakasokiti kuliya kawagambiriti, “Mluwi Mlungu namwingira mukujerwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Shakapanu kawaleka kagenda utali wa muntu kuweza kuguma libuwi, kasuntama na kumluwa Mlungu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Tati pagufira, guyiwusiyi nkata ayi ya ndabiku kwa neni. Ata hangu, mafiliru gaku gafiliziwi, pota ganeni ndiri, ira gutendi ntambu yagufira gumweni.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Palaa wamahoka wa Mlungu kulawa kumpindi wamlawira, su wamtanga. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pakaweriti mu kutama nentu, kamluwiti Mlungu na livuki limlawiti gambira matoni ga mwazi, gaturukiti pasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pakaluwiti kala, kawawuyiriti wafundwa wakuwi, kawawoniti wagonja mpota, womberi waweriti na hinginiku. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawagambira, “Iwera ashi mgonja? Mwimuki na mluwi, namwingira mukujerwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wambata</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:47-56; Mariku 14:43-50; Yohani 18:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera, lipinga lya wantu liza palilongoziwa na Yuda, yumu gwa walii wafundwa lilongu na wawili. Yuda kamgenderiti Yesu na kumnonera. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamgambira, “Yuda! Hashi gwankumgalambuka Mwana gwa Muntu kwa kumnona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wantumini yawaweriti pamuhera na Yesu pawagawoniti galii gagalawira, womberi wakosiya, “Mtuwa tutumii mapanga getu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Na yumu gwawu kamkomiti upanga ntumintumi gwa Mtambika Mkulu na kamdumula likutu lyakuwi lya kumliwu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Palaa, Yesu kalonga, “Ayi itosha!” Kalishinkula likutu lya muntu ayu, kamuponiziya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira watambika wakulu, na wakulu wawalolera wa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wazewi wawiziti kumubata, “Hashi, mwiza na mapanga na vindonga kumbata gambira neni na mpoka? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kila lishaka panweriti pamuhera na mwenga Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu mumbata ndiri. Kumbiti ashi ndo shipindi shenu asa, ndo shipindi sha ukolamlima wa luwindu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:57-58,69-75; Mariku 14:53-54,66-72; Yohani 18:12-18,25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Wamubatiti Yesu na kugenda nayu ukaya kwa Mtambika Mkulu, na Peteru kaweriti kankumfata kwa kutali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Motu waguwashiti pakati pa uwa, na Peteru kaweriti pamuhera na woseri weni waweriti walikala pamuhera pawayoterata motu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ntumintumi yumu mdala pakamwoniti Peteru kalivaga pakwegera na motu, kamjodoleriti masu na kalonga, “Muntu ayu kaweriti vira pamuhera na Yesu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kumbiti Peteru kaberiti pakalonga, “Ndala gwenga, neni nummana ndiri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Shakapanu hera, muntu yumonga kamwona Peteru na kalonga, “Gwenga gwa yumu gwawu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kumbiti Peteru kawankula, “Mtuwa gwenga, neni ndiri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Na lisaa limu pamberi, muntu yumonga kamsisitiza pakatakula, “Nakaka ayu kaweriti pamuhera na Yesu, toziya ayu ndo Mgalilaya vira!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa gwenga, nuvimana ndiri ntambu yagutakula!” Palaa palii, pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera, njogolu kawika. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mtuwa kagalambuka na kumlola Peteru, na Peteru kalihola galii Mtuwa gakamgambiriti, “Leru pamberi njogolu keniwika hagunemi mala ntatu.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Peteru kawukiti kugenda kunja, na kalila nentu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuhigilwa na kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:67-68; Mariku 14:65</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Wantu walii waweriti wankumlolera Yesu, wamkomiti na kumhigira. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Wamtawiti shitambala kusheni, na wankumkosiya, “Gutungi! Gani yakakukomiti?” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Wamlavilira visoweru vivuwa vya kumwigilanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamtula kulongolu mushizyungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 26:59-68; Mariku 14:55-64; Yohani 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Lishaka lyalifatiti Yesu wamjegiti mushizyungu. Pashizyungu kuweriti na wazewi na watambika wakulu na wafunda wa malagaliru, womberi waliwoniti pamuhera na Yesu wamjegiti kulongolu kwawu. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Nawomberi wamgambira, “Gutugambiri! Hashi, gwenga gwa Kristu?” Su Yesu kawagambira, “Ata panuwagambira, hapeni mnjimiri, <verse number="68" style="v"/>handa panuwakosiya hapeni mnankuli. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Kwanjira vinu, Mwana gwa Muntu hakalivagi uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu kana makakala goseri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Woseri walonga, “Ndo kulonga gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mtakula handa ndo Neni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Nawomberi walonga, “Tufira ndiri kayi ukapitawu umonga? Twaweni tupikanira shilii shakatakuliti.”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamjega pashizyungu sha Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 27:1-2,11-14; Mariku 15:1-5; Yohani 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Shikundi shoseri wagolokiti, wamjega Yesu kulongolu kwa Pilatu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wanja kumsitaki, pawalonga, “Tumwoniti muntu ayu kankuwasongiziya wantu wetu, na kuwaberiziya wantu kumupanana kodi Kaisari, pakawagambira Kristu mweni ndo, mfalumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilatu kamkosiyiti yomberi, “Hashi, gwenga ndo Mfalme gwa wayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwankula, “Gwenga gulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilatu kawagambira watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na lipinga lya wantu, “Mona likosa ndiri lyoseri kwa muntu ayu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kumbiti womberi wanjiti kulonga kankuwazongiziya, “Kwa mafundu gakuwi kanjiti kutenda ndewu pakati pa wantu woseri mu Yudeya. Kanjiti mu Galilaya na vinu kiza panu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamjega kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilatu pakapakiniriti aga, kakosiya, “Hashi, muntu ayu ka mwenikaya gwa Galilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakavimaniti handa Yesu kalawiti lushi lwalukolitwimlima na Herodi, su kamjegiti kwa Herodi, ndo mweni yakaweriti mu Yerusalemu shipindi shilii. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Herodi kanemeleriti nentu pakamwoniti Yesu, toziya kapikaniriti kala visoweru vyakuwi, su kaweriti kankuhepera kumwona yomberi kwa shipindi shivuwa. Kaweriti kankutumbira kawoni Yesu pakatenda mauzauza. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Su Herodi kamkosiyiti Yesu makosiwu gavuwa, kumbiti Yesu kamwankula ndiri. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mtambika mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa Malagaliru walawiriti pawulongoru, walaviyiti masitaka gawu kwa makakala nentu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Herodi pamuhera na wanjagila wakuwi, wamwayibishiti Yesu na kumtendera lidufiya, shakapanu wamvalisiya nguwu ya shifalumi, na wamuwuziya kwa Pilatu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwanjira lishaka lilii, Herodi na Pilatu wawera maganja, pamberi pa shipindi shilii waweriti wangondu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamutoza kuhowa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 27:15-26; Mariku 15:6-15; Yohani 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Su Pilatu kawashemiti pamuhera, watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu, na walongoziya na wantu <verse number="14" style="v"/>kawagambira, “Mumjega muntu ayu kwaneni pamlonga kaweriti kawasongiziya wantu wawulemi ufalumi wa Rumi. Vinu mpikiniri! Pandoliti kala weri shitwatila ashi pawulongolu penu, mona ndiri likosa lyoseri kwa masitaka genu kwakuwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wala Herodi kawoniti ndiri likosa, su kamuwuziyiti kwa twenga. Kwahera likosa lya kumtenda muntu ayu kahowi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Su hanuwalongeri wamsyatangi viboku, hanumleki kagendi zakuwi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kila Mumsambu gwa Pasaka Pilatu kamlekiziyaga mtatilwa yumu pakati pawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lipinga lyoseri wabotanga pawalonga, “Gumlagi ayu! Gutuvuguliri Baraba!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Baraba wamtuliti mushibetubetu toziya ya kutenda ngondu mlushi lulii, viraa kalagiti wantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilatu kafiriti kumlekeziya Yesu, su katakula kayi nawomberi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kumbiti womberi watenditi umatu, “Gumkong'onderi misumali mulupingika! Gumkong'onderi misumali mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilatu kawagambira mala ya tatu, “Ashi katenda shidoda gaa? Mona ndiri likosa kwakuwi limtendi yomberi wamlagi, su hanumsyatangi viboku, su hanumlekeziyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kumbiti womberi wakazaniti kutenda umatu kwa kubotanga kuwera Yesu mpaka kakong'onderwi misumali mulupingika, na upeleru wawu wa kutenda umatu ukanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Su Pilatu kaamuwiti ntambu yawafira womberi gatendeki. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kamvugulira kulawa mushibetubetu muntu ulii yawamfiriti, ndomweni yawamtuliti mushibetubetu toziya ya ngondu yakuwi na kulaga wantu, su kamlaviyiti Yesu kwa womberi wamtenderi ntambu yawafira.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumkong'ondera misumali mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 27:32-44; Mariku 15:21-32; Yohani 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pawaweriti wankumjega, waliwoniti na muntu yumu yawamshema Simoni gwa Kureni, kaweriti kankulawa muisi na kwingira mlushi. Su wambata, wamtwika lupingika lulii kalutoli kumbeli kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti, mngati mwawu waweriti wadala wankudaya na kumlilira. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kawagalambukira, kuwagambira, “Mwenga washina mawu wa Yerusalemu! Namundilira neni, kumbiti mlililiri maweni na wana wenu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Toziya mashaka gankwiza, wantu hawalongi, ‘Mbaka kwa walii wagumba, yawaleriti ndiri ama kunonisiya wana!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hashiweri shipindi wantu pawayigambira migongu, ‘Gutuguwiri!’ Na kuvigambira vigongu, ‘Gutugubiki!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwa mana, handa wantu wankugutendera mtera gwankali kuyuma ntambu hayi, hayiweri hashi kwa mtera guyuma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wawatoliti viraa wantu wamonga wawili, wadoda wawalagi pamuhera na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pawasokiti kala pahala pawapashema, “Shipalakasa sha mtuhi,” Yesu ndo wamkong'onderiti misumali mulupingika pamuhera na walii wadoda wawili, yumu uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu na yumu uwega gwakuwi gwa kumshigi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tati guwalekeziyi toziya wavimana ndiri vyawatenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">Shakapanu wagawana nguwu zyakuwi kwa kugalambula simbi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wantu wawagolokiti palii pawamlola. Na walongoziya wamtendera lidufiya pawalonga, “Kawalopoziya wamonga, vinu kalilopoziyi mweni, handa mweni ndo Kristu, msyagula gwa Mlungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wanjagira wamtenderiti vira lidufiya, wamgenderiti wamupa icheshema <verse number="37" style="v"/>pawalonga, “Handa nakaka gwenga ndo Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi, gulilopoziyi gumweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vira vilii malembu aga wagatula kumpindi kwakuwi, “Ayu ndo Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yumu gwa walii wadoda yawakong'onderitwi misumali palupinjika, kamwigilanga Yesu pakalonga, “Hashi, yanakaka ndiri gwenga ndo Kristu? Su gulilopoziyi gumweni, gutulopoziyi na twenga vira.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kumbiti mdoda gwingi ulii kamkalipira muyaguwi pakalonga, “Gwenga gumtira ndiri Mlungu ata padidini? Gwenga gupata azabu iraa ayi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Gwenga na neni tustahili, mana aga ndo malipu ya galii gatutenditi. Kumbiti muntu ayu katenda ndiri shidoda shoseri.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Shakapanu kalonga, “Gwenga Yesu! Gunholi shipindi pagwingira muufalumi waku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kamwankula, Nukugambira nakaka, lelu haguweri pamuhera na neni muparadisu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yesu mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 27:45-56; Mariku 15:33-41; Yohani 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Iweriti yapata saa sita paliwala, mshenji guleka kuwala, luwindu lugubikiti muisi yoseri mpaka saa tisa, <verse number="45" style="v"/>lipaziya lya numba nkulu ya Mlungu lipantika vipandi viwili. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kalila kwa liziwu likulu, Tati, mumawoku gaku nuyitula rohu yangu. Pakalongiti hangu kahowa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Paliya, mkulu gwa wanjagila pakawoniti kala galii gatendikiti kamkwisa Mlungu pakalonga, “Nakaka ayu kaweriti muntu muheri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wantu woseri walii waweriti wajojinika toziya ya shitwatila ashi, pawawoniti galiya gatendikiti, wawuyiti ukaya kwawu pawahinginitiki. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Waganja wakuwi pamuhera na wadala walii wamfatiti kulawa Galilaya, wagolokiti kwa kutali kulola shitwatila shiliya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumsira</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 27:57-61; Mariku 15:42-47; Yohani 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kuweriti na muntu yumu litawu lyakuwi Yosefu, mwenikaya gwa shijiji shimu sha Wayawudi shawashishema Arimatayu. Kaweriti muntu muheri yakapananwa ligoya. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kaweriti muntu yakashemitwi Yosefu kulawa Arimatayu mlushi lwa Yudeya. Kaweriti muntu mheri na yakapananwa ligoya, kaweriti kankuhepera kwiza kwa ufalumi wa Mlungu. Tembera kaweriti Mjumbi gwa shyoteramotu shikulu sha Wayawudi, kajimiliti ndiri nawomberi majimiranu na matendu gawu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yomberi kagenditi kwa Pilatu, kaluwa kamupi nshimba ya Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Su kasulusiya nshimba ilii kulawa mulupingika, kayizyengititi sanda ya shitani, kayitula mulipumba lyaliweriti walisongola mulitalawu, lyeni alyenitenderwi. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lishaka lilii liweriti Ijumaa, na matandiru ga lishaka lya kwoyera liweriti lyankuyanja. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Wadala walii waweriti wafatana na Yesu kulawa Galilaya wamfatiti Yosefu, waliwona lipumba lilii ntambu yawatula nshimba yakuwi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Shakapanu wawuyiti ukaya, watanditi uturi na malashi ga kuswaga nshimba ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Lishaka lya kwoyera woyeriti gambira malagaliru gaamuwiti.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuzyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 28:1-10; Mariku 16:1-8; Yohani 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jumapili mandawira ndaa, wadala walii wagenditi kulipumba pawatola na utuli ulii wawaunyawiti. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wawoniti libuwi lilii libilingisiwa pampenku pa lipumba. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Libuwi libilingisiwa pampeku pa lipumba</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pawingiriti mngati, wawoniti ndiri nshimba ya Mtuwa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wagolokiti palii na waweriti wankulishera kwajili shisoweru shilii, kamukamu hera wantu wawili wazivaliti nguwu zimeremeta mbuu wagolokiti pakwegera na womberi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wadala walii wingiritwi na lyoga, wasuntama. Su wantu walii wawagambira, “Iwera ashi mwankumsakula mkomu pakati pa wahowiti? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ka panu ndiri, kazyuka kala! Mliholi galii gakawagambirani pakaweriti kulii Galilaya, <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mwana gwa Muntu mpaka wamlaviyi kwa wantu wanavidoda, nayomberi hawamkong'onderi misumali mulupingika na lishaka lya tatu hakazyuki kwanjira pakahowiti’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wadala walii waliholiti vyakatakuliti Yesu, <verse number="9" style="v"/>walawiti mulipumba, na watakuliti vintu avi vyoseri kwa wantumintumi walii lilongu na yumu na wamonga wawaweriti paliya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hashina Mariya Magidalena na Yoana na Maliya mawu gwa Yakobu, pamuhera na wadala wamonga wawagenditi nawomberi ndo watakuliti vintu vilii kwa wantumintumi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kumbiti wantumintumi pawapikaniriti ntambu yawatakuliti wadala walii wahera mana, su wawajimilira ndiri. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Su Peteru kalawiti na kagenda pakatuga mpaka kulipumba, kasuntama na kawoniti sanda hera. Kawuyiti ukaya pakawera kankulihola kwajili ya galiya yagalawiriti.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kugenda Emau</para>
  <para style="r">Mariku 16:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lishaka lilalirii, wantu wawili mngati mwa wantu wawamfata Yesu waweriti wankugenda mushijiji shawashishemiti Emawu, utali wa kilumita lilongu na yimu kulawa Yerusalemu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na waweriti wankuyowera kwajili ya goseri galii yagalawiriti. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pawaweriti wankuyowera na kuligambiziyana, Yesu mweni kalawira na kugenda pamuwera nawomberi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamwoniti kwa masu, kumbiti wamumana ndiri. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawakosiya, “Mwankuyowera shishi pamgendagenda?”</para>
  <para style="p">Womberi wagoloka jii, sheni zyawu zihinginikiti. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muntu yumu pakati pawu, yawamshema Kileopa, kamkosiya, “Hashi gwenga gwa muhenga gweka yaku Kuyerusalemu yaguvimana ndiri vitwatira yavirawiriti kulii mashaka aga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawakosiya, “Vitwatila gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Womberi wamwankula, “Vitwatira vyavimpatiti Yesu gwa Nazareti. Muntu ayu kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu kana uwezu kulongolu kwa Mlungu na kulongolu kwa wantu, mukila shintu shakatakuliti na kutenda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Watambika wakulu na wakolamlima wetu wamlaviya wamtozi kuhowa, na wamkong'ondera misumali palupinjika. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na twenga tulitumbira handa mweni ndo kaweri yumu yakagenda kuikombola Israeli! Gamonga ga aga goseri, leru ndo lishaka lya tatu kwanjira vitwatira avi pavirawiriti. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wadala wamu mushipinga shetu watusintuziya, pawagenditi kulipumba mandawira putiputi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>su wayiwoniti ndiri nshimba yakuwi. Wawuyiti pawalonga handa walawiritwi na wantumintumi wa kumpindi, pawawagambiriti handa kaweriti mkomu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wamonga mushipinga mwetu wagenditi kulipumba, wawona galii gawatakuliti wadala walii, su mweni wamwona ndiri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira, “Iwera hashi mwa wazigizigi shiyasi ashi na myoyu yenu ikamala nentu kugajimira goseri galii gatakulitwi na wambuyi wa Mlungu! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hashi, ifiruwa ndiri Kristu kukong'onderwa misumali mulupingika, shakapanu kingiri muukwisa wakuwi?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na Yesu Kawagambira vitwatira vyoseri vya vimuwusu mweni Mumalembu Mananagala mushintola sha Musa na shawalembiti wambuyi woseri wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pawaweriti pakwegera na shijiji shawashigenderiti, Yesu katenda gambira kankwendereya na mwanja, <verse number="29" style="v"/>kumbiti womberi wamluwiti pawalonga, “Gwikali pamuwera na twenga, mana kwinala, na pashiru pankwingira.” Su kingira na kulikala pamuwera nawomberi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pakalivagiti kuliya shiboga pamuwera na womberi, katola libumunda na kulitekelera, shakapanu kalimega na kuwapanana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Masu gawu gavugukiti na wammana, kumbiti kawukiti pamasu pawu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Su waligambirana weni, “Hashi myoyu yetu iweriti iyaka ndiri shipindi pakaweriti kankututakulira Malembu Mananagala munjira kulii?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wawuka shipindi shilaa shilii na wawuyiti Yerusalemu, wawoniti wantumintumi walii lilongu na yumu na walii wamonga waweriti pamuwera pawalijojinira <verse number="34" style="v"/>na walonga, “Nakaka Mtuwa kazyuka! Kamlawira Simoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Su wantumini wawili wawagambira ntambu yagawapatiti munjira, na ntambu yawammaniti pakamega libumunda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wantumini wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 28:16-20; Mariku 16:14-18; Yohani 20:19-23; Matayu 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wantu awili pawaweriti wankuwagambira aga, palaa paliya Yesu mweni kagoloka pakati pawu na kawagambira, “Ponga iweri na mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Walilimuka na waweriti na lyoga pawavimana wawona shihoka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Su Yesu kawagambira, “Iwera ashi mwana lyoga? Iwera ashi myoyu yenu itira? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mloli mawoku gangu na magulu gangu na mloli neni ndo mweni. Mumbati mundoli na hamvimani, mana shihoka shahera nshimba na mafupa ntambu yamndola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Katakuliti aga na kawalanguziyiti mawoku na magulu gakuwi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Waweriti wankali pawagajimira ndiri, toziya ya manemu gawu na wankali wankulishera, Yesu kawakosiyiti, “Mwanashu shiboga shoseri panu shakuliya?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wamupa shipandi sha somba wa kubanika, <verse number="43" style="v"/>kashitoliti na kushiiliya, woseri pawamlola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Shakapanu kawagambira, “Ayi ndo mana ga visoweru vyanuwagambiriti pamweriti pamuhera na mwenga, kila shintu shawalembiti kwajili ya neni Mulilagaliru lya Musa, na mukulemba gawalembiti wambuyi wa Mlungu, na mushintola sha Zaburi gawera nakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Shakapanu kagavugula mahala gawu kugamana Malembu Mananagala, <verse number="46" style="v"/>na kawagambira, “Ashi ndo shawalembiti, Kristu mpaka katabiki na mpaka kazyuki kulawa kwa wahowiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti, <verse number="47" style="v"/>nalitawu lyakuwi muujumbi kwajili ya kuleka vidoda vyawatenda mpaka wawubweri kwa isi zoseri, kwanjira Yerusalemu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mwenga mwa wakapitawu wa vitwatira avi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Na neni mweni hanuwajegerani ulii mweni Tati yakalagiliti kumjega, su muheperi muisi uganu mpaka pawakupanani makakala galawiti kumpindi kwakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankunyasulwa kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayu 28:16-20; Mariku 16:14-18; Yohani 20:19-23; Matayu 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Su Kawalonguziyiti kunja kuisi mpaka Betaniya, kanyasula mawoku gakuwi kumpindi, na kawatekelera. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pakaweriti kankuwatekelera, kawaleka, kanyasulitwi kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Womberi wamguwira, na wawuyiti kugenda Yerusalemu, pawawera na nemeli nkulu, <verse number="53" style="v"/>na walikaliti shipindi shoseri Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu pawamkwisa Mlungu.</para>
</usx>
